<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Zigua Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">MBULI YEDI IWANDIKWE NI</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="im">Chitabu cha Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana ni chimwenga mgati mwe vitabu vine vya Lagano hya vikutambalisa wikazi wa Yesu Kulisito. Chila chimwenga mgati mwe vino chetangwa “Mbuli,” nuko kugamba “Mbuli Yedi.” Chawandikagwa hadya Yesu eze abanike ni Matayo na Luka na Yohana. Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana chindedi yawandikagwa ni msigilwa Yohana hajihi na mhilimo wa 90 AD. Hata hegu chitabu chino hachikulonga kugamba Yohana nuyo mwandisi, ivyo chiwandikwe chaligana ne ibaluwa ya nkongo ya Yohana na baluwa ya kaidi ya Yohana na baluwa ya katatu ya Yohana. Wamwenga mwa wakale wawandika hantu Yohana ekale ni ko mzi wa Efeso mwe chipindi icho, elo vyalagisa kugamba chitabu chawandikagwa ko mzi wa Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kakonga pwilili mwalo we chitabu kwa kuwambiza wantu wazumile kugamba Yesu ni Kulisito, ni Mwana ywa Chohile akwikala (20:31). Kwa kuzumila vino nawatende na wikazi mwe dizina dyakwe. Chitabu chawandikagwa kwa wakusoma wose Wayahudi na sawo Wayahudi. Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana unaikaulisa yesimana na ziya izintuhu izintatu. Alongesa mwe mpituko adamanye Yesu mna hawandikise mwe zisimo zakwe. Mbuli ntuhu zilaile saviya kubatizwa kwa Yesu na kujezwa kwe nyika ivyo haviwandikwe mwe ino Mbuli yedi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vimndani</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana kakonga Mbuli Yedi mwe sula 1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Ukajika niyo awandika mpituko zimwenga Yesu adamanye (1:19-12:50).</para>
  <para style="io">Ukajika atambalisa mbuli zilozize mo wikazi wa Yesu zimbuzize mwe file na kuuya kwakwe (13:1-20:31).</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana abindiliza Mbuli Yedi mwe sula 21 achigambila chipindi chimwenga Yesu awalailaga wantu eze auyuke ukajika akonga mwalo wakwe kwa kuwandika ichitabu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ulosi ukuchinka ujima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aho nkongo hendaga na mntu akwitangwa Ulosi, Ulosi uyo endaga na Chohile, naye endaga Chohile. <verse number="2" style="v" />Kukongela nkongo Ulosi endaga hamwenga na Chohile. <verse number="3" style="v" />Chila chintu chaumbwaga kombokela uyo, hendile uyo, Chohile haumbile chintu chochose. <verse number="4" style="v" />Uyo endaga nkongelo ya ujima, na ujima uwo wendaga ulangazi wa wantu. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ulangazi uwo walangaza mwe chiza, mna ichiza nacho chidunduga kuudaha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chohile amsigilaga msigilwa yumwenga zina dyakwe Yohana, <verse number="7" style="v" />yudya ezaga kuwagambila wantu watimile ulangazi uwo. Ezaga chani wantu wose weve na kuzumila ulosi wakwe. <verse number="8" style="v" />Yohana hendaga uwo ulangazi, mna ezaga du kuwaukuila wantu mbuli yo ulangazi uwo. <verse number="9" style="v" />Uno nuwo ulangazi we chindedi, ulangazi ukwiza mwe isi na kuwamulikila wantu wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ivyo Ulosi uyo endaga uko kwe isi. Hata kugamba Chohile aumbaga isi kombokela uyo wantu woseni we isi hawamzumile. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ezaga mwe isi yakwe mwenye, mna wendile wakwe hawamhokele. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mna wantu wamwenga wamhokela na kumzumila, ivyo awenka udahi wa kuwoneka wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile. <verse number="13" style="v" />Hawatendile wana wa Chohile kwa fanyanyi za chimntu mna nguvu za chimwili, mna kwa udahi wa Chohile mwenye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Naye Ulosi niyo etenda mntu, ekala kwetu, suwe naswi chiuwona ukuka wakwe, ukuka wakwe uyo endile Mwana ichedu ywa Tate, kamema mbazi na chindedi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Yohana awaukwilaga wantu mbuli zakwe, akaguta, “Uyo nuyo nilongile hadya nalongaga, ‘Eza mntu yumwenga anomboke miye, uyo ni mkulu kujinka miye, kwaviya endaga uko sinati kwelekwa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mo ujejeje we izimbazi zakwe zose, suwe chose chihokela mazi kujinka mbazi. <verse number="17" style="v" />Kwaviya Chohile kalavya Sigilizi kwombokela Musa, mna Yesu Kulisito kegala mbazi na chindedi. <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahali mntu amuwone Chohile chipindi chochose mna Mwana ichedu, aligane na Chohile, yudya alungane na Tate, nuyo amtendile chimmanye Chohile.</para>
  <para style="s">Uukuzi wa Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 3:1-12; Mako 1:1-8; Luka 3:1-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uno nuwo ukuzi Yohana aukule mwe Vilongozi wa Chiyahudi uko Yelusalemu wawasigila walavyantambiko na Walawi wamuze, “Weye wiyuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Yohana halemele kuwahitula, niyo alonga pwipwipwi, “Miye suyo Kulisito Mkombola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aho niyo wamuza, “Haluse weye wi yuhi? Togola, weye ni Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yohana niyo ahitula, “Bule! Miye suyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamuza, “Togola, weye ni yudya muwoni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yohana awahitula, “Bule!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Wowo wamuza, “Haluse weye niweye yuhi? Wegaze we mwenye? Chigambile chani chikawagambile wadya wachisigile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yohana awahitula, “Miye ni yudya muwoni Isaya alongaga izimbuli zakwe kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Izwi dya mntu dikwivika kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q">chumizani sila ya Zumbe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Awo wantu nawasigilwa ni bunga dikwitangwa Mafalisayo. <verse number="25" style="v" />Niyo wamuza Yohana, “Uneva weye suyo Kulisito hegu Eliya hegu yudya muwoni, kwa mbwani wabatiza wantu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yohana niyo awahitula, “Miye nabatiza kwa mazi, mna eyuko yumwenga mgati mwenyu hamummanyize. <verse number="27" style="v" />Uyo neze umo hajika komboka, mna miye sikuwagilwa hata kufungula luzigi lwe vilatu vyakwe.” <figure style="fig" desc="" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="JHN 1.27">Mntu availe makwapa</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mbuli zino zoseni zitamwilwa uko Besaniya, ng'ambo yo mto wa Yolodani uko Yohana endaga akabatiza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni ngoto ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zuwa dikutimila, Yohana amwona Yesu akamwizila. Niyo agamba, “Yuno nuyo Mwanangoto ywa Chohile ikusa masa ya wantu we isi! <verse number="30" style="v" />Yuno nuyo nilongile umo hagamba, ‘Homboka miye neze mntu yumwe mkulu kujinka miye, kwaviya endaga uko miye sinati kwelekwa!’ <verse number="31" style="v" />Miye mwenye sammanyize, mna siza kubatiza wantu kwa mazi chani wantu wa Izulaeli wammanye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Yohana nakaukula kugamba, “Simwona Muye Ukukile akasela kulaila kulanga enga suwa manga na kuchima mlanga mwakwe. <verse number="33" style="v" />Miye sammanyize, mna Chohile anisigile ukubatiza wantu kwa mazi na kanigambila, ‘Mntu yudya noumuwone Muye Ukukile akamseila kulaila kulanga na kwikala mnanga mwakwe, uyo nuyo akubatiza kwa Muye Ukukile.’ <verse number="34" style="v" />Yohana agamba, miye siwona,” “naho siukula kugamba yuno nuyo Mwana Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wanampina wankongo wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zuwa dikutimila Yohana nendile naho ehadya hantu aho hamwenga na wanampina wakwe waidi. <verse number="36" style="v" />Eze amwone Yesu akajinka, agamba, “Kaulani! Yuno nuyo Mwanangoto ywa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Awo wanampina wamwiva Yohana akalonga izimbuli izo, niyo wamtimila Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v" />Yesu ahituka eze awawone awo wanampina wamtimila, awauza, “Mwaunga mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamgamba, “Labi, wekala kuhi?” Labi nuko kugamba mhinyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Soni, nanywi namwone.” Awo wanampina wamtimila, wawona hantu endaga akekala. Wasinda naye zuwa idyo. Nayo neikabula saa mlongo nechisingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Anduleya mlukolo ywakwe Simoni Petulo nendile ni yumwenga mgati mwa awo awaidi wendile wamwivile Yohana aho akalonga ivyo. Niyo wamtimila Yesu. <verse number="41" style="v" />Anduleya ambwila Simoni nkongo, mlukolo ywakwe. Amgamba, “Chimwona Masiya.” Masiya nu nukokugamba Kulisito Mkombola. <verse number="42" style="v" />Niyo amwigala Simoni kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amsinya nakumgamba, “Zina dyako nuyo Simoni mwana ywa Yohana, mna nawitangwe Kefa.” Zina dino diligana na Petulo nadyo nu nukokugamba Luwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awetanga Filipo na Nasanieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Zuwa dikutimila Yesu akonga kwita Galilaya. Uko ambwila Filipo na kumgamba, “Nitimila!” <verse number="44" style="v" />Filipo nani mkaya ywa Betisaida, mzi nawakekala Anduleya na Petulo. <verse number="45" style="v" />Filipo ambwila Nasanieli nakumgamba, “Chimwona yudya alongagwa ni Musa mwe chitabu che zisigilizi, naho alongagwa ni wawoni. Nuyo Yesu mwana Yusufu, mntu ywa Nazaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nasanieli auza, “Vino vyadahika chintu chedi chilaile Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Filipo ahitula, “Soo ukaule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Yesu eze amuwone Nasanieli akamwizila, amlongela, “Uyo ni Muizulaeli toti, hena lema!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nasanieli amuza, “Kunimanya vivihi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ahitula, “Nakuwonaga umo nawihasi ho mtini, umo Filipo hanati kukwitanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nasanieli ahitula, “Mhinyi, weye wi Mwana Chohile! Weye wi Seuta ywa Izulaeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Yesu agamba, “Wazumila kwaviya du nakugambilaga kugamba na sikuwona hasi ho mtini? Nauwone mbuli nkulu kujinka zino!” <verse number="51" style="v" />Awagamba, “Nawagambilani chindedi, namwone mbingu zikagubuka na wandima wa kwembingu wa Chohile wakakwela na kusela mlanga mwe Mwana ywa Mntu.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Nyinka mo mzi wa Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuwa dya katatu nakuna nyinka mo mzi wa Kana uko Galilaya. Mamiyakwe Yesu endaga aho, <verse number="2" style="v" />Yesu hamwenga na wanampina wakwe nawo wagonekagwa mwe inyinka iyo. <verse number="3" style="v" />Divai eze isile, nine Yesu amgamba, “Divai iwasila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Mnala, usekunigambila dya kudamanya, chipindi changu hachinati.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aho mamiyakwe awagambila wandima, “Damanyani dyodyose nawagambileni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aho na hana mabiga mtandatu yadamanywe kwa mayuwe, chila dimwe nadikaguha madebe mashano vino, mazwela yakutimilwa ni Wayahudi mwe kwelengusa. <verse number="7" style="v" />Yesu awagamba wandima, “Memezani mazi amabiga yano.” Wayamemeza, <verse number="8" style="v" />niyo awagamba, “Tekani mazi mmwigaile mkulu ywe ngasu”. Wamwigaila mazi, <verse number="9" style="v" />mkulu ywe ngasu eze ayalume yahitukila kutenda divai. Havimanyaga mazi yano uko yalaile, kwaviya wandima watekile amazi nawavimanya, ivyo niyo amwitanga umwali, <verse number="10" style="v" />amgamba, “Chila mntu alavya divai yedi nkongo, hadya wagonekwe wakatenda wanywelesa, alavya idya isokele. Mna weye kuika idivai iyedi kubula vino haluse!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu kadamanya chilagiso icho cha nkongo uko Kana, mzi wa Galilaya, uko kalagisa ukuka wakwe, wanampina wakwe niyo wamzumila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vize viheze, Yesu na mamiyakwe, walukolo wakwe na wanampina wakwe wasela kwita Kapelinaumu nakwikala uko kwa mazuwa majeche.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aita kwe Nyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:12-13; Mako 11:15-17; Luka 19:45-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasaka ya Wayahudi neihaguhi, ivyo Yesu niyo aita Yelusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v" />Umo mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile awabwila wantu watamayombe wakulu wakataga ng'ombe, ngoto na wasuwa manga, wavunja hela wekala mwe izimeza zawo. <figure style="fig" desc="" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="JHN 2.14">Mta yombe akuvunja hela</figure> <verse number="15" style="v" />Elo niyo apilika luzigi saviya msipi na kugulusa ng'ombe hamwenga na ngoto zawo kumlawa mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, akaheza ahitula meza za wadya wata yombe dya hela na kwitila matundu yawo hasi. <verse number="16" style="v" />Niyo awagamba nawakataga suwamanga, “Usani vintu vino hano! Mleke kuitenda Nyumba ya Chohile Tate gwilo!” <verse number="17" style="v" />Wanampina wakwe wakumbuka kugamba Mawandiko Yakukile yagamba, “Chohile, kuyungisa kwangu Nyumba ya Chohile kwanoka saviya moto.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wahitula, “Wadaha kudamanya mpituko yani kulagisa kugamba una uwagila wa kudamanya vino?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Yesu ahitula “Vunani Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, nami naniizenge naho kwa mazuwa matatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aho wayahudi wamuza, “Waunga wiizenge kwa mazuwa matatu? Iguha mihilimo milongo mine na mtandatu kuzenga Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile naikalongwa ni Yesu nuumwili wakwe. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ivyo umo eze auyuke, wanampina wakwe wakumbuka kugamba alongaga ayo, niyo wazumila Mawandiko Yakukile viya alongaga Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Umanyi wa Yesu mwe myoyo ya wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu umo endaga Yelusalemu kwe zuwa Pasaka wantu walozize wamzumila weze wawone vilagiso adamanyaga. <verse number="24" style="v" />Mna Yesu nendile hana uzumizi nawo, kwaviya nakawamanya wose. <verse number="25" style="v" />Havyungigwe yoyose amukuile mbuli zawo, kwaviya uyo mwenye nakavimanya vimwe myoyo yawo.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kwendaga kuna chilongozi yumwenga Myahudi akwitangwa Nikodemo, wa bunga dya Mafalisayo. <verse number="2" style="v" />Chilo chimwenga ambasaga Yesu nakumgamba, “Labi, chimanya kugamba weye wi mhinya usigilwe ni Chohile. Hahali akudaha kudamanya vilagiso ukudamanya uneva Chohile he hamwenga naye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Nakugambila chindedi, hahali akudaha kuuwona Useuta wa Chohile henati kwelekwa nkanana ya kaidi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nikodemo auza. “Mntu mjima adaha vivihi kwelekwa vituhu?” “Havikudahika kwingila vituhu mweinda ya mami yakwe na kwelekwa vituhu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Yesu ahitula. “Nakugambila chindedi,” “Hahana akudaha kwingila mo Useuta wa Chohile henati kwelekwa kwa mazi na kwa Muye. <verse number="6" style="v" />Chikwelekwa ni mntu ni cha chimwili ni tati yakwe na mami yakwe, mna chikwelekwa ni Muye ni muye. <verse number="7" style="v" />Usekwehelwa kwaviya sikugambila kugamba nyuwe mwaungwa mwelekwe uhya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mpeho yavumila kuhinga kudya ikunga, waiva idizwi dyakwe, mna hukuvimanya uko ikulaila hegu uko ikwita. Ni saivyo kwa chila mntu akwelekwa kwa Muye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nikodemo auza. “Vino vyadahika vivihi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Wi mhinya mkulu mwe Izulaeli, naho huvimanyize vino? <verse number="11" style="v" />Nakugambila chindedi, suwe chalonga yadya chimanyize na kuukula milosi chiwone, mna nyuwe hamkunga kuhokela ukuzi wetu. <verse number="12" style="v" />Uneva hamkuzumila umo hawagambilani mbuli ze isi, namdahe vivihi kunizumila, naho. Umo hawagambilani mbuli za kwembingu? <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kujinka idi hahali mntu akweile kwembingu ukaleka Mwana ywa Mntu, aseile hasi kulaila kwembingu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saviya Musa enule kulanga nyoka idamanywe kwa shaba uko kwenyika, saivyo Mwana ywa Mntu nenulwe kulanga, <verse number="15" style="v" />chani chila mntu akumzumila enkigwe ujima wa mazuwa yose. <verse number="16" style="v" />Kwaviya Chohile kaungisa isi vilekile amlavye Mwanawe ywe ichedu, chani chila mntu namzumile asekwaga mna enkwe ujima mazuwa yose. <verse number="17" style="v" />Chohile hamsigile Mwanawe mwe isi chani akantile wantu, mna atende mkombola ywawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mntu yoyose akumzumila Mwana hakantilwe, mna yudya hekumzumila kakantilwa kale, kwaviya hamzumile Mwana ywa ichedu ywa Chohile. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kanto dyalawana savino, ung'azi wiza mwe isi, mna wantu waunga chiza waleka ung'azi, kwaviya ntendwa zawo ziha. <verse number="20" style="v" />Chila yumwe akudamanya wavu ehiwa ung'azi naho haunge kwiza ko ung'azi, kwaviya hakunga wavu wakwe ulangazwe. <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna akudamanya chindedi eza ko ung'azi chani ntendwa zakwe ziwoneke kugamba zadamanywa saviya Chohile alagize.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vikaheza, Yesu na wanampina wakwe waita kwe isi ya Yudeya, uko kekala nawo hamwenga kuno akabatiza wantu. <verse number="23" style="v" />Yohana naye naakabatiza uko Ainoni, haguhi na Salimu, kwaviya uko kwendaga na mazi yalozize. Wantu nawakaita kwakwe naye kawabatiza. <verse number="24" style="v" />Yano yalaila umo Yohana henati kujelwa mndani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kulaila mahigano mgati mwa wanampina wa Yohana na Myahudi yumwenga mwe mbuli ya mazwela yawo ya kwelengusa. <verse number="26" style="v" />Ivyo waita kwa Yohana nakugamba, “Mhinya, wakumbuka yudya mntu endaga hamwenga na weye ng'ambo yo mto Yolodani, yudya waukulaga mbuli zakwe? Kaula, haluse abatiza, naho chila mntu amwitila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Yohana ahitula, “Hahali akudaha kutenda na chintu hanenkigwe ni Chohile ywa kwembingu. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nyuwe wenye mwi waukuzi wangu wa yadya nalongaga, ‘Miye suyo Kulisito, mna sisigilwa chani nimlongweile.’ <verse number="29" style="v" />Mta mwali wa chiche nuyo mwali we chilume, mna mmbuya wo mwali we chiche, yudya akumchimala haguhi na uyo na kumwetegeleza, eleleswa umo akeva izwi dyo umwali we chivyele. Vino nivyo mbwedo wangu uchinta. <verse number="30" style="v" />Aungwa amanyikise miye nami nisinywe hadodo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Akwiza kulaila kwembingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Akwiza kulaila kwembingu ni mkulu kujinka wose. Akulaila kwe isi ni ywa mwe isi naho alonga mbuli za chiisi, mna akwiza kulaila kwembingu ni mkulu kujinka wose. <verse number="32" style="v" />Asimwila yadya awone na kuyeva, mna hahana mntu akuzumila ukuzi wakwe. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mna yoyose akuzumila ulosi wakwe atogola kugamba ukuzi wa Chohile wabunkula chindedi. <verse number="34" style="v" />Yudya asigilwe ni Chohile alonga mbuli za Chohile, kwaviya Chohile amwinka umemo wa Muye wakwe. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tati ywa mntu amunga Mwanawe naho kamwinka vintu vyose vitende mwe mikono yakwe. <verse number="36" style="v" />Akumzumila Mwana ana ujima wa mazuwa yose, hekumwiva Mwana hatende na ujima wa mazuwa yose, mna naasigale mwe maya ya Chohile.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na mvyele Mfambazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mafalisayo naweva kugamba Yesu nakahokela nakubatiza wanampina walozize kujinka Yohana. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mna ichindedi, ni kugamba Yesu habatizaga mntu yoyose, nawakadamanya ivyo ni wanampina wakwe. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ivyo umo Yesu eze eve ayo nayakalongwa, akulawa Yudeya na kuya Galilaya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Mwe ntambo iyo imtenda ajinkile Samaliya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Uko Samaliya abula kwe mzi ukwitangwa Sikali, wendaga wihaguhi ne nkonde idya ya Yakobo amwinkaga mwanawe Yusufu. <verse number="6" style="v" />Hantu aho hendaga na sima dya Yakobo, na Yesu, nakasokezwa ni ntambo, ekala hasi haguhi ne disima. Nani saa chenda vino za nomsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mvyele yumwenga Mfambazi keza kuteka mazi, niyo Yesu amgamba, “Ninka mazi ninywe.” <verse number="8" style="v" />Chipindi icho wanampina wakwe nawaita komzi kwe kugula nkande.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uyo mvyele Mfambazi amgamba, “Weye wi Myahudi, miye nami ni Mfambazi ivyo wadaha vivihi kunilombeza mazi?” Wayahudi hawakudaha kudya ndala na Wafambazi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Uneva hegu wamanyize ntunyo ya Chohile akukwinka naho ni yuhi akukulombeza mazi anywe, nakumlombeza, naye nakakwinka mazi yakukwinka ujima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uyo mvyele agamba, “Zumbe, huna chiya cha kutekela mazi, disima dyenye ni tali. Naupatehi mazi ya ujima? <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni mkale ywetu Yakobo achinkile idisima dino, wanawe na wanyama wakwe wose wanywela idisima dino. Haluse weye wi mkulu kumjinka Yakobo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Wose wakunywa mazi ye idisima dino nawatende na nchilu naho, <verse number="14" style="v" />mna nanywe mazi nanimwinke miye hatende na nchilu naho. Mazi hunga nimwinke nayatende mndani mwakwe mfajo ukunga umwinke mazi yakumwinka ujima. Naho nayamwinke ujima wa mazuwa yose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Uyo mvyele amgamba, “Zumbe, ninka amazi ayo! Chani nise kuwona nchilu vituhu, naho ninasekwiza vituhu hano kuteka mazi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Hita ukamwitange mgosiwo mwizanye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Uyo mvyele ahitula, “Sina mgosi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ahitula, “Kulonga chindeni, ukagamba huna mgosi. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nauna wagosi washano, yuno naye ukwikala naye vino haluse suyo mgosiwo. Kulonga chindedi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uyo mvyele agamba, “Zumbe, nawona kugamba weye wi muwoni.” <verse number="20" style="v" />“Wakale wetu wa Chisamaliya nawamvikila Chohile mo lugulu luno, mna nyuwe Wayahudi mwagamba kugamba Yelusalemu ni hantu chikungwa chimvikile Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Wemvyele nizumila, chipindi nachibule wantu hawamvikile Tate mo lugulu luno hegu kudya Yelusalemu. <verse number="22" style="v" />Nyuwe Wasamaliya mwamvikila hemwimmanyize, mna suwe Wayahudi chimmanya uyo chikumvikila, kwaviya wambulwa walaila kwa Wayahudi. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mna chipindi cheza, naho chibula kale, umo wakumvikila Tate nawalongozwe ni Muye mwe chindedi mo kumvikila Tate. Kwaviya Tate awaunga wakumvikila saivyo. <verse number="24" style="v" />Chohile ni Muye, wantu wakumvikila waungwa wamvikile kwa kulongozwa ni Muye na chindedi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uyo mvyele amgamba, “Sivimanya kugamba Masiya akwitangwa Kulisito neze. Umo akeza nachigambile chila chintu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Miye hulonga na weye nuyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aho wanampina wa Yesu wauya, niyo wehelwa vidala kumwona asimwila na mvyele. Mna hahana amuzize mvyele uyo kugamba, “Waunga mbwani?” Hegu kumuza Yesu, “Nimbwani wasimwila na mvyele yuno?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Uyo mvyele niyo asa idibiga dyakwe hadya, aita komzi na kuwagambila wantu, <verse number="29" style="v" />“Soni mkamwone mntu anigambile mbuli zose nidamanye. Vyadahika kutenda nuyo Kulisito?” <verse number="30" style="v" />Ivyo wantu walawa umzi na kwita kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ichipindi icho wanampina wakwe nawakamhembeleza Yesu, “Mhinyi, udye chochose!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mna Yesu awahitula, “Nina nkande nyuwe hemwimanyize.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ivyo wanampina wakwe wauzana, “Vyadahika kuna mntu amwigaile nkande?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Nkande yangu ni kudamanya yadya akunga yudya anisigile, na kubindiliza ndima yakwe anisigile. <verse number="35" style="v" />Mna lusimo lukugamba, ‘Isigala myezi mine, chikutimila nu uvuni.’ Mna nawagambilani, kaulani izinkonde zaungwa zivunwe! <verse number="36" style="v" />Mvuni alihwa naho achisanya nkande kwa ujima wa mazuwa yose, ivyo mtuhu akuhanda na yudya akuvuna nawelelwe hamwenga. <verse number="37" style="v" />Lusimo ulo ni chindedi, ‘Yumwenga ahanda mtuhu avuna.’ <verse number="38" style="v" />Siwasigilani mkavune mwe nkonde hamwidamanyize ndima, watuhu na wadamanya ndima hano, nyuwe mwahokela mwe ndima yawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Wasamaliya walozize we kaya idya wamzumila Yesu kwaviya yudya mvyele amukwilaga, “Kanigambila zose nidamanye.” <verse number="40" style="v" />Ivyo umo Wasamaliya wambwile Yesu wamlombeza ekala nawo. Yesu niyo ekala aho mazuwa maidi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Wantu walozize niyo wazumila kwa ulosi wa Yesu, <verse number="42" style="v" />wamgamba yudya mvyele, “Haluse hachizumile, siyo kwaviya walongaga, mna kwaviya chimwiva wenye, naho chivimanya kugamba nuyo chindedi Mwambula ywa wantu we isi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mwana ywa chilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Yesu eze abinde mazuwa maidi, niyo aita Galilaya, <verse number="44" style="v" />kwaviya Yesu mwenye aukulaga, “Muwoni hakutunywa kwe isi yakwe.” <verse number="45" style="v" />Eze abule Galilaya, wantu walozize wa uko wamhokela kwaviya wawonaga yose adamanyaga umo waitile Yelusalemu kwe nkande ye Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Yesu niyo auya mo mzi wa Kana uko Galilaya, uko ahitule mazi yakatenda divai. Kwendaga na mkulu yumwenga ywa selikali endaga na mwanawe mnyonje uko Kapelinaumu. <verse number="47" style="v" />Eze eve kugamba Yesu kakulawa Yudeya kabula Galilaya, kamwitila na kumlombeza aite akamhonye mwanawe wa chilume endaga mnyonje wa kubanika. <verse number="48" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Nyuwe hamnawone mpituko na vilagiso hamzumile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mkulu uyo ahitula, “Zumbe, chitanye mwanangu hanati abanike.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Jenda, mwanawo natende na ujima!”</para>
  <para style="p">Uyo mntu niyo azumila ulosi wa Yesu, niyo ahalawa. <verse number="51" style="v" />Achei mwe sila wandima wakwe wadugana naye, wamgamba, “Mwanawo kahona!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Awauza isa umwana ahonile, nawo wamhitula, “Gulo saa mfungate nomsi, unyonje umlekela.” <verse number="53" style="v" />Niyo akumbuka nendile nidya isa Yesu amgambile, “Mwanawo nahone.” Ivyo yeye hamwenga na wantu mwe nyumba yakwe wose niyo wazumila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Chino ni chilagiso cha kaidi adamanyaga Yesu eze auye kulaila Galilaya kubula Yudeya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Uhonyi he bwawa dya mazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vikaheza Yesu niyo aita Yelusalemu kwe ngasu ya Chiyahudi. <verse number="2" style="v" />Kudya Yelusalemu hajihi ne nchili yo mzi uwo ikwitangwa lwivi lwa ngoto, nakuna ndiwa ya mazi ikwitangwa kwa Chiebulaniya Betisaza, naina balaza shano zina mizeze. <verse number="3" style="v" />Wanyonje walozize nawalambala mwe zibalaza, matuntu na viwete na waholomale nawakagoja mazi yatibulwe, <verse number="4" style="v" />kwaviya mndima ywa kwembingu nakasela chila nkanana mndani mwe ndiwa atibule amazi. Mnyonje ywa nkongo kwingila mndani mwa mazi umo yatibulwe, nakahonywa unyonje wose nendile ananawo. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nahana mntu mnyonje kwa mihilimo milongo mitatu na mnane. <verse number="6" style="v" />Yesu eze amwone kagona nakumanya kugamba katenda mnyonje kwa mazuwa yalozize, niyo amuza, “Waunga uhone?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mnyonje ahitula, “Zumbe, sina mntu ywa kuningiza mwe ndiwa ya mazi umo yakatibulwa, chila hajeza kwingila, mntu mtuhu anilongwela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Chimala, guha umcheka wako wite.” <verse number="9" style="v" />Aho mntu uyo niyo ahona, niyo aguha mcheka wakwe, akonga kujenda.</para>
  <para style="p">Mbuli iyo idamanyika mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula, <verse number="10" style="v" />ivyo vilongozi wa Wayahudi wamgamba yudya mntu ahonyigwe, “Dyelo ni Zuwa dya kuhumula, kwa Sigilizi zetu havikungwa wetwike mcheka wako dyelo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahitula, “Yudya mntu anihonyize nuyo anigambile, guha umcheka wako ujende.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Wamuza, “Uyo mntu akugambile ivyo ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mna yudya mntu ahonyigwe hammanyaga Yesu ni yuhi, kwaviya nahana wantu walozize, Yesu naye kahalawa kale.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vize vyajike, Yesu ambwila yudya amhonyize mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile na kumgamba, “Tegeleza, haluse kuhona. Ivyo usekudamanya masa vituhu unase kubwilwa ni mbuli ihise.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Yudya mntu niyo ahalawa na kuwagambila vilongozi wa Wayahudi kugamba Yesu nuyo amhonyize. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ivyo Wayahudi niyo wakonga kumsunkasunka Yesu kwaviya nakadamanya ivyo mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula. <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Tate adamanya ndima chipindi chose, miye nami nadamanya ndima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ulosi uno uwatenda vilongozi wa Wayahudi waungise kumkoma. Siyo kwaviya nakabalanga Sigilizi ya zuwa dya kuhumula du, mna kwaviya kagamba Chohile ni Ise, ivyo ketenda kaligana na Chohile.</para>
  <para style="s">Udahi wa Mwana Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu awahitula, “Nawagambilani ichindedi, mwana hakudaha kudamanya chintu ichedu, adaha kudamanya chiya akumwona Ise adamanya. Chiya akudamanya Tati ya mntu, Mwana naye achidamanya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Kwaviya Tati ya mntu amunga Mwanawe amlagisa chila chintu akudamanya mwenye. Namlagise mbuli nkulu zikujinka zino, nanywi namwehelwe. <verse number="21" style="v" />Saviya Tate akuuyusa wabanike na kuwenka ujima, mwe ivyo Mwana naye awenka ujima wadya akunga. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tate hakukantila yoyose. Kamwinka Mwanawe udahi wose wa kukantila, <verse number="23" style="v" />chani wose wamwive Mwana saviya wakumwiva Tati yamntu. Hekumwiva Mwana hakumwiva Tati ya mntu yudya amsigile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nawagambilani ichindedi, akwiva ulosi wangu, na kumzumila yudya anisigile, ana ujima wa mazuwa yose. Hakantilwe, mna kajinka kale kulaila mo kubanika na kwingila mo ujima. <verse number="25" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, chipindi cheza, naho chibula kale, umo wabanike na weve izwi dya Mwana ywa Chohile, na wadya wakudiva nawatende na ujima. <verse number="26" style="v" />Saviya Tate mwenye nuyo nkongelo yo ujima, nivyo amtendile Mwanawe nkongelo yo ujima. <verse number="27" style="v" />Naho kamwinka Mwanawe udahi wa kukantila, kwaviya ni Mwana ywa Mntu. <verse number="28" style="v" />Msekwehelwa mwe vino. Chipindi cheza umo wabanike wemwezimbila naweve izwi dyakwe, <verse number="29" style="v" />na kulaila mwe zimbila zawo. Wadya wadamanye yedi nawauyuke na kutenda na ujima, mna wadya wadamanye yehiye nawauyuke na kukantilwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Uchindedi mwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Sikudaha kudamanya chintu kwa udahi wangu mwenye. Nakantila saviya hugambilwa ni Chohile kugamba kanto dyangu dyawagila, kwaviya sikudamanya viya hunga, mna viya du yudya anisigile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Uneva heukuila mwenye, hunga nilonge hachihokelwe saiya chindedi. <verse number="32" style="v" />Mna hana mtuhu akunukuila, naho simanya kugamba yose akunilongela ni chindedi. <verse number="33" style="v" />Nyuwe msigila wantu kwa Yohana, naye kaukula ichindedi. <verse number="34" style="v" />Suko kugamba miye naunga ukuzi wa mntu; Nalonga vino chani mdahe kwambulwa. <verse number="35" style="v" />Yohana endaga saviya taa ikwaka na kupulika, naho namkaunga mbwede hadodo ulangazi wakwe. <verse number="36" style="v" />Mna miye nina ukuzi ukulise kujinka udya alavyaga Yohana. Yadya hudamanya, nizo ndima aninkile Tate nizidamanye, zino zanilongela na kulagisa kugamba Tate kanisigila. <verse number="37" style="v" />Naye Tate anisigile nuyo aniukuile kale, nyuwe hamnati kwiva idizwi dyakwe na kumwona, <verse number="38" style="v" />naho ulosi wakwe haukwikala mndani mwenyu kwaviya hamkumzumila yudya amsigile. <verse number="39" style="v" />Nyuwe nanywi mwakaula Mawandiko Yakukile, kwaviya mwafanyanya kugamba mndani mwakwe namwinkwe ujima wa mazuwa yose. Mawandiko ayo nayo yakunukwila! <verse number="40" style="v" />Hata ivyo nyuwe hamkunga kwiza kwangu chani mhokele ujima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Sikulonda ntogozi kulaila kwa mntu. <verse number="42" style="v" />Mna siwamanya nyuwe kugamba mwi wantu hemkumunga Chohile. <verse number="43" style="v" />Miye siza kwa udahi wa Tate, mna hamkunihokela, mna mntu mtuhu akeza kwa udahi wakwe mwenye, namumhokele. <verse number="44" style="v" />Mwadaha vivihi kuzumila kuno nyuwe mwaunga kuhokela ntogozi kulaila kwenyu nyuwe wenye, mna hamkunga ntogozi zikulawa kwa Chohile uyodu. <verse number="45" style="v" />Msekufanyanya kugamba miye naniwalahe nyuwe kwa Tate. Sigilizi za Musa mkwikiya msuhi. <verse number="46" style="v" />Uneva chindedi mwamzumila Musa mnizumile nami kwaviya awandikaga mbuli zangu. <verse number="47" style="v" />Mna hegu hamyazumile yadya Musa awawandikileni, namdahe vivihi kuzumila mbuli hulonga?”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awenka nkande wantu magana milongo mishano</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 14:13-21; Mako 6:30-44; Luka 9:10-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yeze yajinke ayo, Yesu aita ntendele ya kaidi ye diziwa dya Galilaya hegu ziwa dya Tibeliya seivyo nendile hamwenga diketangwa. <verse number="2" style="v" />Lukudidi lwa wantu lwamtimila kwaviya wantu awo nawawona vilagiso nakadamanya kwa kuwahonya wanyonje. <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu niyo akwela kolugulu, ekala hamwenga na wanampina wakwe. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngasu ya Pasaka ya Wayahudi yendaga ihaguhi. <verse number="5" style="v" />Yesu eze akaule na kuwona lukudidi lwa wantu lukeza kwakwe, amgamba Filipo, “Chikagulehi nkande chani wantu wano wadye?” <verse number="6" style="v" />Kalonga ivyo chani amjeze Filipo, kwaviya nakavimanya mwenye ivyo nadamanye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Filipo amhitula, “Hata chendile na matundu yakwitangwa dinali yakubula magana maidi, hayakudaha kugula migate chila yumwenga adye egute.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yumwenga mwa wanampina wakwe, akwitangwa Anduleya, yudya endaga mlukolo ywa Simoni Petulo, amgamba, <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hano hana mbwanga yumwenga mta migate mishano ya shaili na samaki waidi, mna vino navichinte mbwani wantu walozize savino?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu amgamba. “Wekazeni wantu hasi,” Hendaga na mani yalozize ahantu aho. Ivyo wantu niyo wekala hasi, wagosi awodu nawakabula magana milongo mishano. <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu niyo aiguha idya migate, amtogola Chohile, awapangila wantu wadya wekale. Atenda saivyo mwe ziya samaki, na chila mntu kapata saviya aungile. <verse number="12" style="v" />Wantu weze wegute, Yesu awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Logotani vibesulo visigale visekwaga.” <verse number="13" style="v" />Wowo nawo walogota vibesulo vya migate mishano ye shaili wasigaze wadya wantu wadile niyo wamemeza ntangulu mlongo na mbili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Wantu weze wawone chilagiso icho Yesu adamanye, wagamba, “Chindedi yuno nuyo Muwoni akwiza mwe isi.” <verse number="15" style="v" />Yesu niyo amanya kugamba wantu na wakaunga wamguhe wamtende seuta kwa nguvu, niyo aita vituhu kolugulu ichedu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda mlanga mwa mazi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 14:22-33; Mako 6:45-52</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ize ibule chisingi, wanampina wakwe Yesu wasela kubula kwediziwa, <verse number="17" style="v" />niyo wakwela mwe ngalawa, wakonga kudeluka idiziwa wahinge Kapelinaumu. Chiza nachingila, Yesu nendile hanati kuwabwila. <verse number="18" style="v" />Chipindi icho ziwa niyo dyakonga kutibukila kwa chausa cha luzimu lukulu. <verse number="19" style="v" />Wanampina kudya waitile utali wa chilometa shano hegu mtandatu wamwona Yesu akajenda mlanga mwa mazi, akeisogeila ingalawa, niyo wogoha vidala. <verse number="20" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Ni miye!” “Msekogoha,” <verse number="21" style="v" />Nawakaunga wamguhe Yesu mwe ngalawa, aho ingalawa niyo yabula kwe isi nawakaita.</para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wamlonda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mtondo wakwe fyo dya wadya wasigale nkanana ya kaidi ye diziwa. Niyo wabunkula kugamba nakuna ngalawa imwenga du hadya, naho Yesu hengile mwe ngalawa hamwenga na wanampina wakwe, mna wanampina awo nawaita wowo wenye. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngalawa ntuhu, zikulaila Tibeliya, niyo zabula aho wantu wadile imigate Zumbe amtogolaga Chohile. <verse number="24" style="v" />Umo awo wantu weze wabunkule kugamba Yesu na wanampina wakwe hawahali aho, niyo wakwela ngalawa waita Kapelinaumu, wakamlonda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kande ya ujima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Wadya wantu weze wambwile Yesu ntendele ya kaidi ye diziwa, wamuza, “Mhinyi, kubula ini hano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Nawagambilani chindedi, mwanilonda siyo kwaviya muwona vilagiso, mna kwaviya mdile idya imigate niyo mweguta. <verse number="27" style="v" />Msekwevinya kwa nkande ikubanika, mna, kwevinyeni kwa nkande ya ujima wa mazuwa yose. Ino niyo natende Mwana ywa Mntu nawenkeni, kwaviya Chohile, Tate, kajela hula kugamba kamsagula na kumzumila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Wowo niyo wamwuza, “Chitende mbwani chani chisankanile ndima ya Chohile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Ino niyo ndima ya Chohile mumzumile yudya amsigile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aho wamgamba, “Naudamanye chilagiso chani chiwone chani chikuzumile? Nautende chibwani? <verse number="31" style="v" />Wakale wetu wadyaga mana kudya kwedijangwa, saviya viwandikwe mwa mawandiko Yakukile, ‘Kawalisa nkande ilaile kwembingu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Yesu awagamba. “Nawagambilani chindedi,” “Musa hawenkileni nkande ilaile kwembingu, mna Tate nuyo akuwenkani nyuwe nkande ya chindedi ikulaila kwembingu. <verse number="33" style="v" />Kwaviya nkande ya Chohile ni yudya akusela kulaila kwembingu na akwinkiza ujima kwa wantu we isi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Niyo wamgamba, “Zumbe, chinke mgate uwo kalenakale.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Miye nuwo mgate ukujela ujima. Mntu akwiza kwangu halumwe ni sala, yoyose akunizumila halumwe ni nchilu naho. <verse number="36" style="v" />Nasiwagambilani kugamba mniwona mna hamkunizumila. <verse number="37" style="v" />Wose akuninka Tate naweze kwangu, mntu yoyose akwiza kwangu, sanimdule kuse, <verse number="38" style="v" />kwaviya sisela kulaila kwembingu siyo kwaviya hweungila miye, mna kwaviya vikungwa ni yudya anisigile vino. <verse number="39" style="v" />Vino nivyo akunga yudya anisigile, nisekumwaza hata yumwenga mgati mwa wadya aninkile, mna niwauyuse wose zuwa dya udumo. <verse number="40" style="v" />Kwaviya akunga Tate nicho chino, chila namwone Mwana na kumzumila atende na ujima wa mazuwa yose, nami nanimuuyuse zuwa dya uhelo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Wayahudi wakonga kumng'ung'uzikila Yesu kwaviya nakagamba, “Miye ni mgate useile kulaila kwembingu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Wagamba, “Togola, yuno suyo Yesu mwana ywa Yusufu? Ise na nine Chiwamanya! Ivyo adaha vivihi kulonga kugamba kasela kulaila kwembingu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Lekani kung'ung'uzikilana. <verse number="44" style="v" />Hahana mntu akudaha kwiza kwangu, ukaleka wadya wakwesigwe kwangu ni Tate anisigile hana mkwesize kwangu, nami nanimuyuse mwedizuwa dyo udumo. <verse number="45" style="v" />Mwa mawandiko ya wawoni muwandikwa vino, wantu wose nawatende wahinywa ni Chohile, chila mntu akumwiva Tate na kuhina kwakwe eza kwangu. <verse number="46" style="v" />Ivyo hulonga ni vino, hahana mntu amwone Tate, yudya alaile kwa Chohile nuyo du amwone Tate. <verse number="47" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, mntu akuzumila ana ujima wa mazuwa yose. <verse number="48" style="v" />Miye nuyo mgate ukujela ujima. <verse number="49" style="v" />Wakale wenyu wadyaga nkande ikwitangwa mana kudya kwedijangwa, mna niyo wabanika. <verse number="50" style="v" />Mna ino ni nkande ikusela kulaila kwembingu chani yoyose naidye asekubanika. <verse number="51" style="v" />Miye nuyo mgate ukujela ujima useile kulaila kwembingu. Mntu yoyose na adye nkande ino nekale mazuwa yose. Nkande nanimwinke nu mwili wangu huulavya kwa chausa cha ujima wa wantu we isi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Naho wayahudi wakonga kuhigana mgati mwawo; “Yuno adaha vivihi kuchinka umwili wakwe chiudye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Nawagambilani chindedi, hamnadile mwili wa Mwana ywa Mntu na kunywa isakame yakwe, hamtende na ujima mndani mwenyu. <verse number="54" style="v" />Nadye umwili wangu na kunywa sakame yangu ana ujima wa mazuwa yose, nami nanimuuyuse mwe zuwa dya uhelo. <verse number="55" style="v" />Kwaviya mwili wangu ni nkande ya chindedi, na sakame yangu ni chikunywegwa cha chindedi. <verse number="56" style="v" />Nadye umwili wangu na kunywa isakame yangu, ekala mndani mwangu, nami nekala mndani mwakwe. <verse number="57" style="v" />Saviya Tate anisigile eli mjima, nami nekala kwa chausa cha nguvu zakwe; Seivyo akudya umwili nekale kwa chausa cha nguvu zangu. <verse number="58" style="v" />Uno ni mgate useile kulaila kwembingu, siyo saviya mana wadile wadalahala wenyu, niyo wabanika. Akudya umgate uno natende mjima mazuwa yose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Yesu alongaga ayo umo endile akahinya mwe nyumba yo kumvikila Chohile kudya Kapelinaumu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ikuleta ujima wa mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ivyo, wanampina walozize weze weve ivyo, wagamba “Yano ni mahinyo madala! Ni yuhi akudaha kuyategeleza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Yesu nakamanya hegambilwe ni mntu kugamba wanampina wakwe na wakang'ung'uzika mwe mbuli iyo, niyo awauza, “Togolani mbuli ino ni ndala? <verse number="62" style="v" />Navitende vivihi hegu hadya namumwone Mwana ywa Mntu akakwela kwita kudya endaga nkongo? <verse number="63" style="v" />Muye wa Chohile nuyo ukuleta ujima, mna nguvu za mntu hazikutenda chintu. Mbuli zino niwagambileni ni za Muye Ukukile zikuleta ujima. <verse number="64" style="v" />Mna weyaho mgati mwenyu hewekuzumila.” Yesu nakalonga ivyo kwaviya nakamanya kukongela nkongo ni wahi hawamzumile, naho ni yuhi namhituke. <verse number="65" style="v" />Akaheza agamba, “Nivyo vikuleka nasiwagambilani kugamba hahana akudaha kwiza kwangu hanadahizwe ni Tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Kulawana na ayo, watendile wanampina wakwe walozize wauya kunyuma, wasekutimilizana naye vituhu. <verse number="67" style="v" />Ivyo, Yesu niyo awauza wadya mlongo na waidi, “Togolani nanywi mwaunga mwite kwenyu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Simoni Petulo amhitula, “Zumbe, chite kwa yuhi? Weye una ulosi ukujela ujima wa mazuwa yose. <verse number="69" style="v" />Suwe chazumila, naho chimanya kugamba weye nuyo Mkuka ywa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Togolani siwasagulani nyuwe mlongo na waidi? Mna yumwe ywenyu ni Mwavu!” <verse number="71" style="v" />Yesu nakalonga ayo kwachausa cha Yuda Isikaliote, mwana Simoni Isikaliyote kwaviya nuyo akunga amhituke, hata uneva nendile yumwe ywa wadya wanampina mlongo na waidi.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na wanduguze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eze viheze, Yesu na akatalamka uko Galilaya. Haungile kutalamka ko mkoa wa Yudeya kwaviya Wayahudi nawakaunga wamkome. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngasu ya Wayahudi ikwitangwa ngasu ya makumbi naihaguhi. <verse number="3" style="v" />Walukolo wa Yesu niyo wamgamba, “Halawe hano wite Yudeya chani wanampina wako waziwone ndima ukudamanya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Hahana mntu akudamanya mbuli kwa chefiso kuno aunga amanyike mwa wantu. Elo Kwaviya wadamanya mbuli sazino, kwelagise mwa wantu we isi yose.” <verse number="5" style="v" />Hata walukolo wakwe welekanywe hawamzumile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Chipindi changu chiligane hachinati kubula. Mna kwenyu nyuwe chila chipindi chaligana. <verse number="7" style="v" />Wantu wa mwe isi ino hawakudaha kuwaihiwa mna wanihiwa miye kwaviya naukuila mbuli zakwe kugamba ziha. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nyuwe hitani kwe ngasu iyo, miye sikwita, kwaviya saa yangu iligane hainati kubula.” <verse number="9" style="v" />Kalonga ayo akaheza asigala uko Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kwe ngasu ya wakumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Walukolo wa Yesu weze waite kwe ngasu, Yesu naye niyo aita, mna haitile mo lumpe mna kwa kwefisa. <verse number="11" style="v" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi nawakamlonda kwe ngasu iyo wauza, “Ekuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nakuna ntakalisi zilozize mwedifyo dya wantu. Wamwe wawo wagamba, “Ni mntu ywedi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Watuhu wagamba, “Bule! Awaza wantu.” <verse number="13" style="v" />Mna hahana mntu ajezize kulonga mbuli zakwe mwolumpe kwa kogoha vilongozi wa Chiyahudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngasu iyo ize ibule mgati, Yesu naye niyo aita mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, akonga kuhinya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Wayahudi wehelwa nakugamba, “Mntu yuno kamanya vivihi naye hasomile mwe shule?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aho Yesu awahitula, “Mahinyo huhinya sayo yangu, mna ni yayudya anisigile. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mntu akunga adamanye yadya akunga Chohile, namanye kugamba mahinyo yangu yalaila kwa Chohile, hegu yalaila kwangu mwenye. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mntu akulonga kwa udahi wakwe mwenye elondela ntogozi yakwe mwenye. Mna yudya akulonda ntogozi ya yudya amsigile ni mkanuni, naho mndani mwakwe hamna wihi wowose. <verse number="19" style="v" />Togolani, Musa hawenkile Sigilizi? Hata ivyo hahana hata yumwenga ywenu akuitoza. Ni mbwani mkunga mnikome?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aho fyo dya wantu wamhitula, “Una mpepo weye! Ni yuhi akunga akukome?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Kuna mbuli imwenga nidamanye, nanywi mwayehelwa. <verse number="22" style="v" />Musa awenkagani sigilizi ya kujela ngasu mwe zuwa dya kuhumula, Kwa chindedi sigilizi iyo hailaile kwa Musa mna kwa wababa zenyu. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mna hegu mntu ajelwa ngasu hata mwe zuwa dyo Kuhumula chani msekubalanga Sigilizi ya Musa, ni mbwani mwanihiwa kwa chausa cha kumhonya mntu mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula? <verse number="24" style="v" />Msekukantila kwa kukaula mbuli za kuse du. Lavyani kanto dikuwagila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Togola yuno ni Kulisito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Wantu wamwenga wa Yelusalemu walongaga, “Togola yudya mntu wakumlonda wamkome suyo yuno? <verse number="26" style="v" />Kaulani haluse! Awafunda mo lumpe, hahali mntu wa kumgambila ulosi. Vyadahika vilongozi wabunkula chindedi kugamba yuno nuyo Kulisito? <verse number="27" style="v" />Kulisito aho akwizila hahana mntu na amanye hantu alaile, mna suwe chimanya uko alaile mntu yuno!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Umo Yesu nakahinya mdya mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, niyo alonga kwa kuguta, agamba, “Hambwe mnimanya naho uko nilaile mkumanya? Sizile kwa udahi wangu mwenye, uyo anisigile miye ni ywa chindedi! <verse number="29" style="v" />Mna miye simmanya kwaviya silaila kwakwe, uyo nuyo anisigile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Wantu nawakaunga wamgwile, mna hahana mntu ajezize kumgwila kwaviya saa yakwe nahainati kubula. <verse number="31" style="v" />Wantu walozize mwe idifyo wamzumila, niyo wagamba, “Togola, Kulisito akeza nadamanye chilagiso chikulu chitendese chikujinka adamanye yuno?”</para>
  <para style="s">Wankondo wasigilwa kumgwila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mafalisayo nawaweva wantu wa katakalisana mbuli zawo zikumlanga Yesu. Wowo hamwenga na walavyantambiko wakulu niyo wawasigila wankondo wamgwile. <verse number="33" style="v" />Yesu agamba, “Nichei na nyuwe kwa chipindi chidodo, haheza nanite kwa yudya anisigile. <verse number="34" style="v" />Namnilonde mna hamniwone, na hadya hwita nyuwe hamdahe kubula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi walonga wowo wenye, “Mntu yuno naite kuhi kudya hachikudaha kumwona? Naite kwa Wagiliki wazagale mgati mwa Wayunani, na kuwahinya Wayunani? <verse number="36" style="v" />Uyo alonga kugamba, nachimlonde mna hachimuwone, naho kugamba hachidahe kwita kudya natendeke. Alonga vivihi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Mito ya mazi ya ujima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mwe zuwa dya uhelo naho zuwa kulu dya ngasu Yesu nakachimala, akaguta, “Mntu yoyose mta nchilu neze kwangu anywe. <verse number="38" style="v" />Saviya Mawandiko Yakukile yawandikwe, akunizumila miye, mito ya mazi yakwinkiza ujima naijuluzike kulaila mo moyo wakwe!” <verse number="39" style="v" />Nakalonga ayo kwa Muye Ukukile yudya nahokelwe ni wadya nawamzumile Yesu. Mwe chipindi icho Muye Akukile nendile hanati kusigilwa, kwaviya nendile hanati kutogolwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mswesano mgati mwa wantu kwa mbuli ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Wantu wamwenga mgati mwe difyo weze weva izimbuli izo, niyo wagamba, “Chindedi mntu yuno ni muwoni aungigwe eze!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Wantu watuhu wagamba, “Yuno nuyo Kulisito Mwambula!”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna watuhu wagamba, “Togola, naidahike vivihi Mkombozi alawe Galilaya? <verse number="42" style="v" />Mawandiko Yakukile hayagambile kugamba Kulisito nelekwe Beselehemu, mzi wa Daudi!” <verse number="43" style="v" />Niyo kwalaila maswesano mwe idifyo kwa mbuli ya Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v" />Wantu wamwenga nawakaunga wamgwile, mna hahana ajezize kumgwila.</para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wa Wayahudi hawakuzumila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Wakaheza wadya wamizi niyo wauya kwa walavyantambiko wakulu na Mafalisayo. Niyo wawauza, “Nimbwani hammwigale?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Wamizi wawahitula, “Hahana mntu ajezaga kulonga savino akulonga mntu yuno!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mafalisayo wawauza, “Togolani, nanywi mdantika? <verse number="48" style="v" />Togolani, mumwona kale yumwenga mwe vilongozi wa wantu hegu yumwenga mwa Mafalisayo amzumile? <verse number="49" style="v" />Mna wantu hewemanyize Sigilizi ya Musa, waligitwa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Yumwenga ywa Mafalisayo endaga aketangwa Nikodemo, yudya aho nkongo amwitilaga Yesu. Niyo awagamba, <verse number="51" style="v" />“Togolani, Sigilizi zenyu zamkantila mntu henati kumwiva na kumanya adamanya mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Wowo wamhitula, “Togola, weye nawe kulaila Galilaya? Haya, kayakaule Mawandiko Yakukile weye nawe nauwone kugamba Galilaya hakukulawa muwoni!” <verse number="53" style="v" />Niyo chila yumwenga aita kwe kaya yakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mvyele agwiligwe mwe ugonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu niyo aita ko lugulu lwa Mizeituni. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mtondo wakwe niyo aita vituhu kwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, wantu wose niyo wambasa, naye niyo ekala awahinya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Wahinya sigilizi na Mafalisayo wamwigaila mvyele yumwenga afingigwe mwe ugonyi, wamchimalisa hagatigati hawo. <verse number="4" style="v" />Wamgamba Yesu, “Mhinya! Mvyele yuno kafingwa akagonywa. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mwe Sigilizi yetu Musa achilagizaga mvyele esavino atoigwe mayuwe. Haluse weye wagaze?” <verse number="6" style="v" />Walonga ivyo chani wamtegele, chani wamlahe. Mna Yesu enama hasi, awandika hasi nedidole dyakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Umo wachimale aho wakamuza, Yesu enuka, awagamba, “Mntu hena masa mgati mwenyu namtowe yuwe dya nkongo.” <verse number="8" style="v" />Akaheza enama vituhu, awandika hasi. <verse number="9" style="v" />Weze weve ivyo, niyo wakonga kuhalawa yumwe yumwe, wakalongola wadalahala. Yesu niyo asigala ichedu, na yudya mvyele, kachimala ahadya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu eze enuke, amuza yudya mvyele, “Wadya wantu wekuhi? Togola, hahali hata yumwenga akukantile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uyo mvyele niyo amhitula, “Zumbe, hahali hata yumwenga!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu naye amgamba, “Miye nami sahukantile. Hita kwako, na kukongela vino haluse usekudamanya masa vituhu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ulangazi we isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Yesu eze alonge nawo vituhu, awagamba, “Miye nuyo ulangazi we isi. Mntu yoyose akunitimila miye hajende mwechiza, mna natende na ulangazi wa ujima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mafalisayo wamgamba, “Weye weukwila mwenye, kwaivyo kwelongela kwako siyo chindedi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Hata hegu nelongela mwenye, ulongelo wangu ni wachindedi kwaviya miye simanya kudya nilaile na kudya hwita. Mna nyuwe hammanyize uko hulawa hegu kudya hwita. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nyuwe mwakanta kwa fanyanyi za chimtu, mna miye sikumkantila mntu. <verse number="16" style="v" />Hata hakanta, nkanto dyangu ni dya chindedi kwaviya miye sichedu, Tate, anisigile ehamwenga na miye. <verse number="17" style="v" />Iwandikwa mwe Isigilizi yenyu kugamba ukuzi wa wantu waidi ni wachindedi. <verse number="18" style="v" />Miye neukwila mwenye, Tate naye anisigile, anukwila ivyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aho niyo wamwuza, “Tati yako ekuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu awahitula, “Uneva nyuwe hamnimanyize miye iviya hamummanyize Tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Yesu alongaga milosi iyo mwe chumba che hazina endaga akahinya mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile. Naho hahali mntu amgwile, kwaviya chipindi chakwe chendaga hachinati kubula.</para>
  <para style="s">Hamkudaha kwita kudya miye hwita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba vituhu, “Naita, nanywi namnilonde, mna nambanike mwe masa yenyu. Uko hwita miye nyuwe hamkudaha kubula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo wagamba, “Togola, nekome mwenye? Ni mbwani agamba, ‘Uko hwita nyuwe hamkudaha kubula?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe mlawa ahano hasi, miye silaila kulanga, nyuwe ni we isi ino, miye suyo we isi ino. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nivyo vikuleka siwagambilani nambanike mwe masa yenyu. Uneva hamnazumile kugamba ‘Miye Nuyo’, nambanike mwa masa yenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Wowo niyo wamwuza, “Weye ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ahitula, “Siwagambilani kukongela nkongo! <verse number="26" style="v" />Nina yalozize ya kulonga, na kuwakantila. Yudya anisigile ni chindedi, miye nami nawagambila wantu wose we isi mbuli ziya du nivile kulaila kwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hawavimanyaga kugamba Yesu endaga akalonga nawo ya Tati yakwe. <verse number="28" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Umo namheze kumwinula Mwana ywa Mntu, aho naho nammanye kugamba, ‘Miye Nuyo’, naho kugamba sikudamanya chochose kwa udahi wangu, mna nalonga du yadya Tate anihinyize. <verse number="29" style="v" />Yudya anisigile ehamwenga na miye, uyo hanilekile ichedu kwaviya mazuwa yose nadamanya yadya yakumwelela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eze alonge ayo wantu walozize niyo wamzumila.</para>
  <para style="s">Chindedi nachikutende ulekeilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba wadya Wayahudi wamzumile, “Uneva mnayatoza mahinyo yangu, namtende wanampina wangu chindedindedi. <verse number="32" style="v" />Ivyo nammanye chindedi, naho chindedi nachiwalekeileni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Wowo wamhitula, “Suwe ni welekwa wa Bulahimu, naho hachinati chitende watumwa wa mntu yoyose yudya. Ni mbwani ukugamba namlekeilwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Nawagambilani chindedi, chila mntu yoyose akudamanya masa ni mtumwa ywa masa. <verse number="35" style="v" />Mtumwa hana wikazi wa mnyumba mazuwa yose, mna Mwana ana wikazi wa mazuwa yoseni. <verse number="36" style="v" />Uneva Mwana awalekeileni namtende mlekeilwa chindedi. <verse number="37" style="v" />Simanya kugamba nyuwe mwi lukolo lwa Bulahimu. Mna mwaunga mnikome kwaviya hamnati kuzumila mahinyo yangu. <verse number="38" style="v" />Miye nalonga yadya anisigile Tate, mna nyuwe mwadamanya yadya mgambilwe ni tati yenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Wowo wamhitula, “Suwe chi wana wa Bulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu awagamba, “Uneva nyuwe mwendile wana wa Bulahimu namdamanya saviya adamanye Bulahimu. <verse number="40" style="v" />Miye siwagambilani ichindedi nivile kwa Chohile, mna nyuwe mwaunga mnikome. Bulahimu hatendile ivyo! <verse number="41" style="v" />Nyuwe mwadamanya mbuli iziya adamanye tati yenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wowo niyo wamgamba, “Suwe hachi wana wa halamu! China Tati yetu yumwenga du nuyo Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Uneva Chohile endile Tati yenyu chindedi, namkanunga miye, kwaviya miye nasilawa kwa Chohile haluse ni hano. Sizile kwa udahi wangu miye mwenye, mna kwa uyo anisigile. <verse number="43" style="v" />Ni mbwani hammanyize ayo hulonga? Ni kwaviya hamkudaha kwetegeleza ulosi wangu. <verse number="44" style="v" />Nyuwe mwi wana wa tati yenyu Mwavu naho mwonga du kudamanya tama za tati yenyu. Uyo endaga mkomi kukongela nkongo, hana uchimailo mwe chindedi, kwaviya chindedi hachimuli mndani mwakwe. Chila aho akulongela lulimi, alonga kulawana na ihali yakwe yo kumbigwa, kwaviya mwenye ni mlulimi naho tati yamntu ywa udanti wose. <verse number="45" style="v" />Mna kwaviya miye nalonga chindedi, nivyo vikuleka nyuwe hamkunizumila. <verse number="46" style="v" />Ni yuhi mgati mwenyu akudaha kulagisa kugamba miye sidamanya masa? Uneva nalonga chindedi, ni mbwani hamkunizumila? <verse number="47" style="v" />Mntu ywa Chohile ategeleza mbuli za Chohile, mna nyuwe hamkutegeleza kwaviya nyuwe hamwi wantu wa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu neyaho Bulahimu henati kwelekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Wayahudi wamhuluta Yesu wamgamba, “Togola, hachilongile chindedi kugamba weye wi Msamaliya, naho una mpepo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Miye sina mpepo. Miye namtunya Tate, mna nyuwe hamkunitunya. <verse number="50" style="v" />Miye sikwelondela ntunyo yangu mwenye, eyuko yumwenga mta kuilonda ntunyo iyo, uyo ni mkanti. <verse number="51" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, mntu yoyose akutozesa mahinyo yangu habanike mazuwa yose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Wayahudi wagamba, “Weye una mpepo! Bulahimu abanikaga, na wawoni nawo wabanikaga. Nawe wagamba, akutozesa mahinyo yangu habanike mazuwa yose! <verse number="53" style="v" />Togola, wetenda mkulu kujinka tati yetu Bulahimu yudya abanikaga, hata wawoni wabanikaga. Weye wetenda wi yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Hegu nasetunya miye mwenye, ntunyo yangu siyo chintu. Tate yudya nyuwe mkugamba ni tati ywenyu, Chohile nuyo akunitunya. <verse number="55" style="v" />Nyuwe hamwammanyaga, mna miye simmanya. Mna ninagamba simmanyize, nanitende mlulimi saviya nyuwe. Miye simmanya naho natoza ulosi wakwe. <verse number="56" style="v" />Bulahimu, tati yenyu endaga na chinyemi awone idizuwa dyangu dyokwizila, adionaga, niyo elelwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Wayahudi wamgamba, “Weye hunati kubuza mihilimo milongo mishano, weye nawe kumwona Bulahimu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Nawagambilani chindeni, Bulahimu hanati kwelekwa, ‘Miye Niyaho’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Aho niyo walogota mayuwe chani wamtowe, mna Yesu niyo agila, alawa mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu elekwe tuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu umo akajinka, niyo amwona mntu yumwenga, tuntu ivyo elekwa. <verse number="2" style="v" />Wanampina wamuza, “Mhinyi, ni yuhi adamanye masa, mntu yuno, hegu welesi wakwe vilekile elekwe tuntu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Mbuli ino hailaile kwa chausa cha masa yakwe uyo, hegu masa ya welesi wakwe. Mna elekagwa tuntu chani ndima za Chohile ziwoneke zikadamanya ndima mndani mwakwe. <verse number="4" style="v" />Kuche nomsi chongigwa chijendeleze kudamanya ndima ya yudya anisigile. Kwaviya chilo cheza hadya mntu hadahe kudamanya ndima. <verse number="5" style="v" />Chipindi nichei mwe isi, miye ni ulangazi we isi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eze alonge ayo, niyo atwa mate hasi, adamanya ntagata, amhaka yudya tuntu mwa meso. <verse number="7" style="v" />Amgamba, “Hita ukahake mwe ndiwa ya Silowamu.” Silowamu kugamba ni asigilwe. Aho uyo tuntu niyo aita, akuhaka, akaheza auya akawona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Wantu we haguhi naye na wadya wammanyize kugamba aho nkongo nanimchiwa akulombeza, wagamba, “Togola, yuno suyo yudya mchiwa nakekala na kulombeza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Wamwenga wawo wagamba, “Nuyo.” Mna wamwenga wagamba, “Suyo uyo, mna wata kufanana du.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yudya endile tuntu agamba, “Ni miye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Wamuza, “Haluse meso yako yafungulwa vivihi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uyo naye awahitula, “Yudya mntu akwitangwa Yesu kadamanya ntagata, anihaka mwa meso, niyo anigamba nite nikahake mwe ndiwa ya Silowamu. Aho miye naita, nahaka, niyo nawona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Wamuza, “Uyo ekuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Awahitula, “Miye simanyize!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wauza mbuli ya kuhonywa mntu tuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Akaheza wamwigala uyo mntu endaga tuntu kwa Mafalisayo. <verse number="14" style="v" />Zuwa idyo Yesu adamanye ntagata na kumfumbula ameso mntu uyo nendile ni zuwa dya Kuhumula. <verse number="15" style="v" />Mafalisayo niyo wamuza mntu uyo, “Kutenda vivihi niyo wawona?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mntu uyo awagamba, “Kanihaka ntagata mwa meso, miye nami niyo nahaka haluse nawona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mafalisayo watuhu wagamba, “Mntu yuno adamanye ivyo halaile kwa Chohile, kwaviya hakutoza sigilizi ya zuwa dya Kuhumula.”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna watuhu wagamba, “Mntu mta masa adaha vivihi kudamanya vilagiso savino?” Niyo kwatenda na mahigano mgati mwawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mafalisayo wamuza vituhu uyo mntu endaga tuntu, “Weye wamgaze mntu uyo akufumbule ameso yako?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mntu uyo awagamba, “Mntu uyo ni muwoni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi hawakuzumila kugamba mntu uyo endaga tuntu aho nkongo vino haluse awona, kubula hadya weze wawetange welesi wakwe. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ivyo wawauza awo welesi, “Togolani, yuno nuyo mwana wenyu mkugamba nakelekwa tuntu? Haluse katenda vivihi awona?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Welesi wakwe wahitula, “Suwe chimanya ni mwanetu, naho nakelekwa tuntu. <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna hachimanyize kawona vivihi, naho hachimmanyize yudya amfumbule ameso. Muzeni mwenye, uyo ni mntu mjima, adaha kwelongela mwenye.” <verse number="22" style="v" />Welesi wakwe walonga ivyo kwaviya nawakawogoha vilongozi wa Wayahudi kwaviya vilongozi awo nawevana kugamba mntu yoyose nazumile Yesu ni Kulisito nabalazwe kuse kwe nyumba yo kumvikila Chohile. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nivyo vilekile welesi wakwe walongaga kugamba, “Uyo ni mntu mjima, muzeni mwenye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Niyo wamwitanga vituhu yudya endaga tuntu, wamgamba, “Mtogole Chohile! Suwe chimanya kugamba mntu yuno ni mta masa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mntu uyo niyo ahitula, “Uneva ni mta masa, miye simanyize. Mna chintu chimwenga nimanyize, nendaga tuntu, haluse nawona!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Wamuza, “Kakudamanya chibwani? Kakufumbula vivihi ameso yako?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Uyo mntu awahitula, “Siwagambilani kale, nyuwe nanywi hamkwiva. Ni mbwani hamkunga kwiva vituhu? Togolani nyuwe nanywi mwaunga mtende wanampina wakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mna wowo niyo wamhitula wakagamba, “Weye wi mwanampina ywakwe, suwe chi wanampina wa Musa. <verse number="29" style="v" />Suwe chimanya kugamba Chohile alongaga na Musa, mna mntu yuno hachimmanyize kalawahi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mntu yudya awahitula, “chino ni chilozo! Nyuwe hammanyize uko alaile, mna kanifumbula ameso yangu! <verse number="31" style="v" />Chivimanya kugamba Chohile hakuwetegeleza wantu wata masa, mna amwetegeleza yoyose mta kumzumila na kudamanya viya akunga. <verse number="32" style="v" />Kukongela kumbwa kwe isi hainati kwivika kugamba mntu kamhonya meso mntu elekwa tuntu. <verse number="33" style="v" />Uneva mntu uyo halaile kwa Chohile, nahekudaha kudamanya chochose!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Wowo wamhitula, “Weye kwelekwa na kukwila mwe masa. Vino wadaha vivihi kuchihinya suwe?” Niyo wambalaza mwe nyumba yo kumvikila Chohile.</para>
  <para style="s">Utuntu wa Chimuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Yesu eva kugamba wambalaza mwe nyumba yo kuvikila yudya mntu amhonyize. Eze amwone, amuza, “Togola, weye wamzumila Mwana ywa Mntu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Uyo mntu ahitula, “Zumbe, nigambila ni yuhi chani nimzumile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Kuheza kumwona, uyo akulonga na weye haluse nuyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Uyo mntu agamba, “Zumbe, nazumila!” Niyo amvikila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Yesu agamba, “Miye siza mwe isi kuwakantila wantu, chani matuntu wawone, na wadya wakufanyanya wawona watende matuntu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wendaga hamwenga weze weve izimbuli izo, wamuza, “Togola, wachigamba suwe naswi chi matuntu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Uneva mwendile matuntu, hamwatendile na masa. Mna haluse nyuwe mwagamba, ‘Suwe chawona!’ Ivyo yalagisa kugamba mche na masa.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mdimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Nawagambilani chindedi, mntu yoyose hekwingila mwe didewa dye zingoto kwa kujinkila ko lwivi, mna afifinya na kwingila kwa sila ntuhu, uyo ni mbavi, naho ni mpolaganyi. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mna mntu akwingila kujinkila ko lwivi, uyo nuyo mdimi we zingoto. <verse number="3" style="v" />Mdima lwivi lwa dewa amvugwila, na ngoto zeva mluzi wa mdimi, naye azitanga izingoto zakwe chila imwenga kwa zina dyakwe na kuzilongoza kuse. <verse number="4" style="v" />Akaheza kuzilavya kuse, azilongwela, izingoto nazo zamtimila, kwaviya zimanya umluzi wakwe. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngoto izo hazikudaha kumtimila mjeni, mna zamsumka kwaviya hazimanyize umluzi wakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Yesu nakawagambila umliganyo uwo, mna wowo hawamanyize viya nakaunga awagambile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mdimi ywedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba vituhu, “Nawagambilani chindedi, miye ni lwivi lwa dewa dya ngoto. <verse number="8" style="v" />Wantu wose wezile sinati kwiza ni wabavi na wapolaganyi, mna izingoto haziwategeleze. <verse number="9" style="v" />Miye ni lwivi. Mntu yoyose akwingila kwa kujinkila kwangu nambulwe, nengile na kufosa naho nenkigwe nkande. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mbavi eza kwa chausa cha kubawa, kukoma na kubalanga. Miye siza mtende na ujima, ujima uchintile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Miye ni mdimi ywedi. Mdimi ywedi alavya ujima wakwe kwa chausa cha ngoto zakwe. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mntu wa kulihwa uyo suyo mdimi, naho ngoto siyo zakwe. Hadya akudiwona ngugwa dyeza, azasa izingoto na kuguluka, akaheza ngugwa dyazigwila na kuzimwagalisa. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mdimi uyo hasinye izingoto, nanyilike kwaviya ni mta kulihwa du. <verse number="14" style="v" />Miye ni mdimi ywedi we izingoto. Sizimanya ngoto zangu, nazo zanimanya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Saviya Tate animanyize, nami nivyo nimmanyize. Miye nalavya ujima wangu kwa chausa che zingoto. <verse number="16" style="v" />Naho nina ngoto ntuhu hazimuli mwe didewa dino. Vyanunga nizilete izo nazo, nazo nazive umluzi wangu, naho nakutendeke fyo dimwe dya mdimi yumwenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tate anunga kwaviya nalavya ujima wangu chani niuhokele vituhu. <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahali mntu akunihoka ujima wangu, miye naulavya kwa kunga mwenye. Nina udahi wa kulavya na udahi wa kuuguha vituhu. Ivyo nivyo Tate anisigile nitende.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Naho kwatenda na mihigano mgati mwa Wayahudi kwa chausa cha milosi ino Yesu alongile. <verse number="20" style="v" />Wantu walozize wagamba, “Ana mpepo, naho ni mchilalu! Ni mbwani mkumwetegeleza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna wantu watuhu wagamba, “Ino siyo milosi ya mta mpepo. Togolani, vino mpepo zadaha kufumbula meso ya matuntu?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alemelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uko Yelusalemu kwendaga na ngasu ya kukumbuka usuntwa wa Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile. Chipindi icho ni chipindi cha mpeho. <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu naye nakatalamka mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile mwe balaza ya Sulemani. <verse number="24" style="v" />Wayahudi wamzunguluka, wamuza, “Nauchase na nkama kubula ini? Uneva weye ni weye Kulisito Mkombola, chigambile pwipwipwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Siwagambilani, mna hamzumile. Ndima hudamanya kwa zina dya Tate nizo zikunukwila. <verse number="26" style="v" />Mna nyuwe hamkunga kuzumila kwaviya nyuwe hamwi ngoto zangu. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngoto zangu zategeleza izwi dyangu, miye sizimanya, nazo zanitimila. <verse number="28" style="v" />Miye nawenke ujima wa mazuwa yose, nawo hawage mazuwa yose, naho hahali mntu nadahe kuwausa mwe mikono yangu. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tate aninkile awo ni mkulu kujinka wose, naho hahali mntu akudaha kuwalavya mwe mikono yakwe. <verse number="30" style="v" />Miye na Tate chiyumwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Wayahudi niyo waguha mayuwe chani wamtowe. <verse number="32" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Siwalagisani ndima zilozize kulaila kwa Tate. Ni ihi mgati mwe izo ikuwatendani mnitowe mayuwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Wayahudi wamhitula, “Hachikukutowa mayuwe kwa chausa cha ndima zedi udamanye, mna kwa chausa cha kumhuluta Chohile. Weye mwenye wi mntu du mna wetenda Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Togolani, haiwandikwe mwe chitabu cha Sigilizi zenyu kugamba, ‘Miye silonga nyuwe ni milungu?’ <verse number="35" style="v" />Chohile kawetanga ‘milungu’ wantu wadya wenkigwe ulosi wakwe, na suwe naswi chimanya kugamba Mawandiko Yakukile yalonga chindedi mazuwa yose. <verse number="36" style="v" />Saviya Tate kanisagula miye, naho kanisigila kwe isi. Nimbwani, mkugamba namhuluta Chohile kwaviya sigamba miye ni Mwana ywa Chohile? <verse number="37" style="v" />Uneva sikudamanya ndima ziya Tate akununga nidamanye, msekunizumila. <verse number="38" style="v" />Mna uneva nazidamanya, hata uneva hamkunizumila miye, zumilani izo izindima, chani mmanye na kukombaganya kugamba Tate ekala mndani mwangu, nami nekala mndani mwa Tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Wajeza kumgwila naho, mna acholopoka mwe mikono yawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Yesu niyo aita vituhu ntendele ya kaidi yo umto wa Yolodani, hadya hantu Yohana endaga akabatiza wantu. Niyo ekala uko. <verse number="41" style="v" />Wantu walozize wamwitila wakagamba, “Yohana hadamanye vilagiso vyovyose. Mna yadya yose alongile ya mntu yuno ni chindedi vitendese.” <verse number="42" style="v" />Wantu walozize aho niyo wamzumila Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s">File ya Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mntu yumwenga akwitangwa Lazalo, mkaya wa Besaniya endaga mnyonje. Besaniya wendaga mzi ekale Maliyamu na lumbudye Matha. <verse number="2" style="v" />Maliyamu nani lumbudye dya Lazalo. Naho nuyo amkulugute Zumbe mavuta ya kupwepweleka mwe viga na kumhangusa ne zifili zakwe. Nani mlukolo ywawo Lazalo endaga mnyonje. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ivyo awo walumbuze dya Lazalo wasigila ulosi kwa Yesu kugamba, “Zumbe, mbuyaye ukumunga ni mnyonje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Yesu eze eve ivyo, agamba, “Unyonje uwo suwo wa file, mna ulaila chani Chohile atogolwe, kalumwa chani kwa sila iyo Mwana Mntu atogolwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Yesu nakamunga Matha, lumbudye Maliyamu, hamwenga na Lazalo. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eze eve imbuli kugamba Lazalo ni mnyonje, Yesu ajendeleza kwikala hantu aho endaga kwa mazuwa maidi yongezekele. <verse number="7" style="v" />Akaheza awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Chiteni vituhu Yudeya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Wanampina wamgamba, “Mhinyi, chipindi chijihi du chijinkile Wayahudi nawaunga wakukome kwa mayuwe, weye nawe waunga wite uko vituhu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Togola, saa za msi sizo mlongo na mbili? Mntu akajenda nomsi hakudaha kukowadika, kwaviya awona ulangazi we isi ino. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mna mntu akajenda nechilo nakowadike, kwaviya ulangazi haumuli mndani mwakwe.” <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu eze abinde kulonga milosi iyo, awagamba, “Mbuyangu Lazalo kagona, mna miye nanite hamwinule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Wanampina wakwe wamgamba, “Zumbe, uneva kagona, nahone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yesu nakalonga kugamba Lazalo kabanika, mna wanampina wakwe nawakagamba nakalonga mwe kugona ntongo. <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagambila pwipwipwi, “Lazalo kabanika. <verse number="15" style="v" />Mna selelwa kwa chausa chenyu kugamba sendile uko, chani mzumile. Haluse chiteni kwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tomaso, yudya akwitangwa pacha awagamba wanampina weyawe, “Chiteni naswi chikabanike hamwenga naye!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nuyo uyuso na ujima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu eze abule uko, kabwila umwili wa Lazalo wikwa mwe mbila kwa mazuwa mane. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ikaya ya Besaniya neihaguhi na Yelusalemu, uhale ukubula maili ntatu vino. <verse number="19" style="v" />Wayahudi walozize nawabula kwa Matha na Maliyamu wawahongeze kwa kubanika mlukolo ywawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Matha eze eve kugamba Yesu eza, niyo aita akumsingila, mna Maliyamu kasigala kukaya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Matha amgamba Yesu, “Zumbe, hegu wendile wihano, mlukolo ywangu habanike! <verse number="22" style="v" />Mna simanya kugamba hata vino haluse chochose noumlombeze Chohile nakwinke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Mlukolo ywako nauyuke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Matha niyo amhitula, “Simanya,” “kugamba nauyuke mwe zuwa dya udumo.” <verse number="25" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Miye nuyo uyuso na ujima. Akunizumila miye nekale, hata hegu kabanika, <verse number="26" style="v" />naho chila akwikala na kunizumila habanike mazuwa yose, Togola wayazumila ayo?” <verse number="27" style="v" />Matha amgamba, “Heye Zumbe!” Ahitula “Nazumila kugamba weye nuyo Kulisito, Mwana ywa Chohile, yudya akwiza mwe isi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Matha eze alonge ayo, niyo aita akumwitanga lumbudye Maliyamu kwa chinyele, na kumgamba, “Mhinyi ehano,” “naho akwitanga.” <verse number="29" style="v" />Maliyamu eze eve ivyo, niyo asunguza kwinuka ambasa Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v" />Yesu nahanati kwingila mwe kaya, mna nachei ahadya hantu Matha ambwile. <verse number="31" style="v" />Wayahudi nawemndani hamwenga na Maliyamu wakamhongeza, weze wamwone kenuka akumpukila kuse. Wamtimila wakagamba akwila kwe mbila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Maliyamu eze abule hantu hadya Yesu endile, eze amwone, amgwela heviga. Amgamba, “Zumbe,” “hegu wandile wihano, mlukolo ywangu habanike!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Yesu eze amwone aila, naho eze awawone wadya Wayahudi wendile hamwenga naye nawo waila, niyo engilwa ni mbazi na chinyulu, niyo engilwa ni tumbwaziko mo moyo. <verse number="34" style="v" />Niyo awauza. “Mumhamba hahi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamgamba. “Soo uwone, Zumbe,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Yesu niyo aila. <verse number="36" style="v" />Wayahudi wagamba. “Kaulani ivyo amungile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mna wantu watuhu wagamba, “Togola yuno amfumbule ameso yudya tuntu, vino hakudaha Kumtenda Lazalo asekubanika?”</para>
  <para style="s">Lazalo auyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu engilwa ni tumbwaziko vituhu mo moyo, abula kwe mbila, mbila yenye neimwe bome naho naigubikwa na yuwe mwe nchili. <verse number="39" style="v" />Yesu agamba. “Usani idiyuwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">Matha, lumbudye dya yudya abanike, amgamba, “Zumbe, akonga kulavya mpofa, kekala mwe mbila mazuwa mane!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Togola sikugambile kugamba ukazumila nauwone ukulu wa Chohile?” <verse number="41" style="v" />Niyo wadyusa diya idiyuwe. Yesu niyo asinya kulanga kwembingu na kugamba, “Nakutogola weye, Tate, kwaviya weye waniva. <verse number="42" style="v" />Simanya kugamba waniva mazuwa yose, mna silonga ivyo kwaviya wantu wano we hano, chani wazumile kugamba weye ni weye unisigile.” <verse number="43" style="v" />Eze alonge ivyo, niyo etanga kwa izwi kulu, “Lazalo, fosa kuse!” <verse number="44" style="v" />Niyo afosa kuse, kuno katalizwa sanda mwe viga na mwe mikono, naho uso wakwe ugubikwa na kasuche. Yesu awagamba, “Mfunguleni,” “Mumlekeni aite.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ubala wa kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:1-5; Mako 14:1-2; Luka 22:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ivyo Wayahudi walozize wendile wamtalamkile Maliyamu weze wawone mbuli iyo adamanye Yesu, niyo wamzumila. <verse number="46" style="v" />Mna wamwenga wawo waita kwa Mafalisayo na kuwagambila mbuli Yesu adamanye. <verse number="47" style="v" />Kwa ivyo Mlavyantambiko mkulu na Mafalisayo waika chitala na kugamba, “Chitende vivihi? Mntu yuno adamanya vilagiso vilozese!<figure style="fig" desc="" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="JHN 11.47">Mlavyantambiko ywa Chiyahudi</figure> <verse number="48" style="v" />Chinamleka du ajendeleze, wantu wose nawamzumile, naho vilongozi wa Walumi nawo naweze kuibalanga inyumba yetu ya Chohile na wantu wetu wose!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Aho yumwenga ywawo, akwitangwa Kayafa, endaga Mkulu ywa walavyantambiko mo mhilimo uwo, awagamba, “Nyuwe hammanyize chintu! <verse number="50" style="v" />Hammanyize kugamba ni vyedi kwenyu mntu yumwenga abanike kwa chausa cha wantu, ukuleka wantu we isi njima wakomwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Uyo halongile ivyo kwaviya akunga mwenye, mna kwaviya endile Mkulu wa walavyantambiko mo mhilimo uwo, ivyo nakabunkula kugamba Yesu nabanike kwachausa cha hewemzumile Chohile, <verse number="52" style="v" />naho ukubanika kwakwe siyo kwa chausa cha wantu we isi ino du, mna seiviya kwa chausa cha wana wa Chohile wazagale chani waikwe mwe umwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kulaila zuwa idyo vilongozi wa Chiyahudi walonda sila ya kumkoma Yesu. <verse number="54" style="v" />Yesu niyo hajendile vituhu mo lumpe mwe isi ya Yudeya, mna kahalawa aho na kwita hantu haguhi na jangwa, mwe mzi ukwitangwa Efulaimu, ekala uko hamwenga na wanampina wakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ngasu ye Pasaka ya Wayahudi naihaguhi, ivyo wantu walozize kulaila mwe kaya waita Yelusalemu chani wakelenguse Pasaka hainati. <verse number="56" style="v" />Nawakamlonda Yesu, weze wadugane hamwenga mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, wauzana, “Mwafanyanya vihi? Heze mwe ingasu?” <verse number="57" style="v" />Wakulu wa walavyantambiko na Mafalisayo nawasigila kugamba mntu namanye hantu eli Yesu, awagambile chani wamgwile.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahakwa mavuta uko Besaniya</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:6-13; Mako 14:3-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mazuwa mtandatu ye dizuwa dye Pasaka, Yesu niyo abula Besaniya, endaga akekala Lazalo, yudya mntu Yesu amuyusaga. <verse number="2" style="v" />Uko na wamwikiya nkande ya chisingi, uyo Matha nendile akawasankanila, Lazalo nendile ni yumwe wa wadya wendaga hamwenga na Yesu hemeza. <verse number="3" style="v" />Maliyamu niyo aguha nusu lita ya mavuta matana ya yombe kulu, amkuluguta Yesu mwe viga, na kumhangusa kwa fili zakwe. Nyumba yose niyo yamema malashi yedi. <verse number="4" style="v" />Yuda Isikaliyote, yumwenga mwe wadya wanampina mlongo na waidi yudya akunga amtage Yesu, agamba, <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ni mbwani malashi ayo yasekutagwa kwa hela zilozize na kuwapangila wachiwa?” <verse number="6" style="v" />Kalonga ivyo, siyo kwaviya naakawaungisisa wachiwa, mna kwaviya na ni mbavi. Nkanana zilozize nakabawa kulaila mndani mwe mpamba iyo. <verse number="7" style="v" />Mna Yesu agamba, “Mlekeni! Mlekeni ayaike kwa chausa che dizuwa dyo kuhambwa kwangu. <verse number="8" style="v" />Wachiwa na mtende nawo mazuwa yose, mna hamtende na miye mazuwa yose.”</para>
  <para style="s">Njama za kumkoma Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Wayahudi walozize naweva kugamba Yesu nendile Besaniya, wabula uko, siyo kwa chausa cha kumuwona Yesu mna seivyo nawakaunga kumkaula Lazalo, yudya Yesu amuuyuse. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ivyo walavyantambiko wakulu wadamanya mzungu wamkome Lazalo naye, <verse number="11" style="v" />kwaviya kwa chausa cha Lazalo wayahudi walozize wawahituka vilongozi wawo, niyo wamzumila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engila Yelusalemu kwa chinyemi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:1-11; Mako 11:1-11; Luka 19:28-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zuwa dya kaidi, fyo kulu dya wantu wezile kwe zuwa kulu dye Pasaka weva kugamba Yesu nendile mwe sila kwiza Yelusalemu. <verse number="13" style="v" />Waguha matambi ya mitende wafosa wakamsingile, waguta wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q">“Chohile ajimbikwe! Ajimbikwe yuno akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe!</para>
  <para style="q">Ajimbikwe Seuta ywa Izulaeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu niyo akwela mwana mwe mpunda, saviya mawandiko yakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Msekogoha, wantu wa mzi wa Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q">Kaula Seuta ywenyu eza,</para>
  <para style="q">kakwela mwana mpunda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Wanampina wakwe hawabunkule izi mbuli izo nkongo, mna chipindi Yesu eze aheze kutunywa, niyo wakumbuka kugamba mbuli ziya ziwandikwa mwa uyo na viya wamtendile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Fyo dya wantu wadya wendile hamwenga na Yesu umo amwitangaga Lazalo kulaila mwe mbila niyo amuuyusa waukula mbuli zilaile. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ivyo nivyo vilekile fyo dya wantu wamsingila, kwaviya wose weva kugamba Yesu nendile kadamanya chilagiso icho. <verse number="19" style="v" />Mafalisayo niyo wagambilana, “Mwawona, Hachikudaha ng'o! Kaulani, isi yose wamtimila!”</para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wamwenga wamlonda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hendaga na Wagiliki wamwenga mgati mwa wantu waitile Yelusalemu kuvika mwe ngasu iyo. <verse number="21" style="v" />Awo niyo wamwitila Filipo mkaya ywa Betisaida mwe isi ya Galilaya, wagamba, “Mkulu, chaunga chimwone Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Filipo aita, amgambila Anduleya, wowo nawo waidi waita wamgambila Yesu. <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Saa ya kutunywa kwa Mwana ywa Mntu ibula. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, mpuluzi ya ngano yasigala mpuluzi du mna hadya ikugwela mo ulongo nakubanika. Uneva inabanika, yeleka matunda yalozize. <verse number="25" style="v" />Akunga wikazi wakwe nawaze, akwihiwa wikazi wakwe mwe isi ino nawike kwa chausa cho ujima wa mazuwa yose. <verse number="26" style="v" />Akunga anisankanile aungwa anitimile, ivyo nuko kugamba hohose hadya na nitendeke miye naho no mndima ywangu natende. Na Tate namtunye mntu yoyose akunisankanila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli ye file yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Haluse muye wangu wehelwa, nanigambe mbwani? Nigambe, ‘Tate, nambula mwe mbuli na zinizile mwe saa ino’? Mna nivyo vikuleka siza chani nijinke mwe isaa ino. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tate, ditunye idizina dyako!”</para>
  <para style="p">Aho izwi dyevika kulaila kwembingu, “Situnya, naho naniditunye vituhu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Fyo dya wantu wendile wachimala aho weva izwi idyo, wamwenga wawo wagamba ni mlulumo, wamwenga wagamba, “Mndima ywa kwembingu kalonga naye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mna Yesu niyo awagamba, “Izwi idyo hadivike kwa chausa changu miye, mna kwa chausa chenyu. <verse number="31" style="v" />Haluse nicho chipindi che isi ino kukantilwa, haluse Ibilisi, zumbe ywe isi ino naalagazwe. <verse number="32" style="v" />Miye nami naninulwe kulanga kulaila hasi he isi nanimkwese chila yumwenga kwangu.” <verse number="33" style="v" />Kwa kulonga ivyo kalagisa nabanike vivihi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Fyo idyo niyo dyamhitula, “Suwe chagambilwa ni sigilizi yetu kugamba Kulisito nekale mazuwa yose, haluse wadaha vivihi kugamba Mwana Mntu aungwa enulwe? Uyo Mwana Mntu ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Ung'azi uchei na nyuwe kwa chipindi chiguhi, talamkani mche mnanawo uwo ung'azi chani chilo chise kuwabwila, kwaviya akutalamka mwe chiza hamanyize uko akwita. <verse number="36" style="v" />Umo mnanawo uwo ung'azi uzumileni chani mtende wantu wa ung'azi.” Eze alonge imilosi iyo,</para>
  <para style="s">Wantu hawakuzumila</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo ahalawa hekumanya aita hekukumanyika. <verse number="37" style="v" />Hatahegu Yesu na kadamanya mpituko ino yose mwa meso yawo, wowo hawamzumile. <verse number="38" style="v" />Ivyo milosi alongile muwoni Isaya niyo yalaila;</para>
  <para style="q">“Zumbe ni yuhi auzumile ulosi wetu?</para>
  <para style="q">Naho udahi wa Zumbe ugubulwa kwa yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ivyo hawadahile kuzumila kwaviya Isaya nakalonga vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Chohile kajela utuntu ameso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">kazibalanga izifanyanyi zawo,</para>
  <para style="q">wasekuwona kwa meso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">wasekumanya kwa fanyanyi zawo,</para>
  <para style="q">naho wasekunihitukila, alonga Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q">chani niwahonye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Isaya kalonga imilosi ino kwaviya kauwona ukulu wa Yesu, niyo alonga mbuli zakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mna vilongozi walozize Wayahudi niyo wamzumila Yesu, mna kwachausa cha Mafalisayo, hawalongile holumpe kwa kogoha kugamba na wasentwe ne nyumba yo kuvikila. <verse number="43" style="v" />Nawaungisa kutogolwa ni wantu kujinka kutogolwa ni Chohile.</para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Yesu naukantile wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Aho Yesu aguta, “Mntu akunizumila miye, hakunizumila miye du, mna amzumila yudya anisigile. <verse number="45" style="v" />Akuniwona miye amwona na uyo anisigile. <verse number="46" style="v" />Miye ni ung'azi nami siza mwe isi chani wose wakunizumila wasekusigala mwe ichiza. <verse number="47" style="v" />Akwiva ulosi wangu mna hakuutoza, miye sanimkantile kwaviya sizile nikantile wantu we isi mna kwikombola. <verse number="48" style="v" />Hekutoza ulosi wangu ananaye wakumkantila, ulosi udya nilongile ni mkanti ywakwe zuwa dyo udumo. <verse number="49" style="v" />Miye silongile kwa udahi wangu mwenye, mna Tate nuyo anisigile nilonge mbwani naho nilonge vivihi. <verse number="50" style="v" />Miye nami simanya kugamba sigilizi yakwe yegala ujima wa mazuwa yose. Miye nalonga du yadya Tate anisigile niyalonge.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awahaka wanampina wakwe iviga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nendile ni zuwa heinati kubula ngasu ya Pasaka. Yesu nakamanya kugamba chipindi chakwe cho kuhalawa he isi kwita kwa Ise chibula, nakawaungisa mazuwa yose wantu wakwe we mwe isi, chindedi na nakawaungisa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Yesu na wanampina wakwe nawekala wakadya nkande ya chisingi. Mwavu nakamjela kale Yuda mo moyo wakwe, mwana Simoni Isikaliyote nkwina ya kumtaga Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu nakamanya kugamba Tati ywakwe nendile kamwinka udahi woseni, nakugamba uyo mwenye alailaga kwa Chohile naho auya kwa Chohile. <verse number="4" style="v" />Niyo ahalawa hemeza, avula isuche yakwe ya kuse, efunga mkumbulu mwe chigudi. <verse number="5" style="v" />Akaheza ajela mazi mwe lwiga akonga kuwahaka wanampina wakwe iviga na kuwahangusa kwa udya mkumbulu efungile mwe chigudi. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ambwila Simoni Petulo, uyo amgamba, “Zumbe, weye wanihaka iviga vyangu miye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Hukumanya haluse chino hudamanya, mna nauvimanye aho nyumani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Petulo amgamba, “Weye honihake iviga ng'o!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula, “Sinakuhakile iviga vyako.” “Hotende na umbuya na miye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simoni Petulo amhitula, “Zumbe, use kunihaka iviga ivyodu, naho! Nihaka imikono yangu no mtwi, nawo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Ahakile kale hakungwa ahake, mna mwe viga du. Kwaviya mwili wakwe mjima ulenguka, nyuwe mlenguka mna sawo nyoseni.” <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu nakammanya yudya akunga amtage, nivyo vikuleka akagamba, “Nyuwe woseni, ukaleke yumwenga, Mlenguka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Yesu eze aheze kuwahaka iviga, niyo avala vituhu isuche yakwe ekala mwe meza, awauza, “Togolani, mbunkula yano niwatendileni?” <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nyuwe mwanitanga Mhinyi na Zumbe, nanywi mwalonga vyedi, kwaviya nivyo nili. <verse number="14" style="v" />Iviya miye ni Zumbe na Mhinyi wenyu, siwahakani nyuwe iviga. Nyuwe mwaungwa mhakane wenye iviga. <verse number="15" style="v" />Siwenkani mliganyo, chani nyuwe nanywi mdamanye savino niwadamanyizeni. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, mtumwa suyo mkulu kujinka mkulu wakwe, naho msigilwa suyo mkulu kujinka yudya amsigile. <verse number="17" style="v" />Haluse mmanya imbuli ino, mnaidamanya namjimbikwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Sikulonga mwa nyuwe woseni, siwamanya wadya nisagule. Mna yaungwa yano yakulongwa mwa Mawandiko Yakukile yachinte, ‘Yudya endile hadya hamwenga naye kanihituka.’ <verse number="19" style="v" />Nawagambilani nyuwe vino haluse mbuli zino hazinati kulaila, chani umo zikeza kulaila, mzumile kugamba ‘Miye Nuyo.’ <verse number="20" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, akumhokela yudya humsigila anihokela miye, naho akunihokela miye amhokela yudya anisigile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli yo kuhitukwa kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:20-25; Mako 14:17-21; Luka 22:21-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu eze aheze kulonga ivyo, niyo engilwa ni tumbwaziko ditendese mo moyo, alonga ho lumpe, “Nawagambilani chindedi, yumwe ywenyu nanihituke!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Wanampina niyo wasinyana, kwaviya hawamanyize amlonga yuhi. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mwanampina yumwenga, yudya Yesu nendile akamungisa, nendile kamwegamila Yesu hadya he nkande. <verse number="24" style="v" />Simoni Petulo amdakula na kumgamba, “Muze, amlonga yuhi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mwanampina uyo asogela haguhi vitendese na Yesu amuza, “Zumbe, ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Yudya nanimwinke kabesu ka mgate nitwezize mwe chiya, nuyo.” Ivyo aguha kabesu ka mgate, akatweza mwe chiya, amwinka Yuda, mwana ywa Simoni Isikaliyote. <verse number="27" style="v" />Yuda Isikalioti eze ahokele akabesu ako ko mgate, Shetani niyo amwingila. Yesu amgamba, “Chiya ukunga udamanye sunguza uchidamanye!” <verse number="28" style="v" />Mna hahali hata yumwenga mwe wadya wekale hadya hemeza amanyize ni mbwani Yesu kamlonga ivyo. <verse number="29" style="v" />Kwaviya Yuda nuyo endile akaika mkwiji we mpamba, wamwe wawo nawakafanyanya kugamba Yesu nakamgamba agule vikungwa mwe dizuwa idyo, hegu kugamba nakamgamba akalavye chochose kwa wachiwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Yuda Isikalioti eze aguhe kadya akabesu ko mgate niyo afosa kuse aho. Nendile ni nechilo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Yuda Isikalioti eze ahalawe, Yesu agamba, “Haluse ukulu wa Mwana ywa Mntu ulagiswa, haluse ukulu wa Chohile nawo ulagiswa kwa sila yakwe. <verse number="32" style="v" />Naho uneva ukulu wa Chohile ugubulwa kwa sila yakwe, ivyo Chohile naugubule ukulu wa Mwana ywa Mntu mndani mwakwe mwenye, na adamanye ivyo aho. <verse number="33" style="v" />Wanangu, nichei na nyuwe kwa chipindi chijihi du. Na mnilonde, mna haluse nawagambilani yadya nihezize kuwagambila vilongozi wa Wayahudi, ‘Nyuwe hamdahe kwita uko hwita miye.’ <verse number="34" style="v" />Nawenkani sigilizi mpya, unganani. Saviya miye niwaungileni nyuwe, chani mungane wenye. <verse number="35" style="v" />Wantu wose nawamanye kugamba nyuwe mwi wanampina wangu, uneva mkaungana wenye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga viya Petulo akunga amhituke</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:31-35; Mako 14:27-31; Luka 22:31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Simoni Petulo amuza, “Zumbe, waita nahi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula. “Hukudaha kunitimila uko hwita,” “Mna na unitimile nyumani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Petulo amgamba, “Zumbe, ni mbwani sikudaha kukutimila haluse?” “Miye semalanya kale nilavye ujima wangu kwa chausa chako!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Togola, wadaha chindedi ulavye ujima wako kwa chausa changu? Nakugambila chindedi, zogolo hadinati kwila nonihituke nkanana ntatu!”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ni sila ya kwita kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagambila wanampina wakwe. “Msekwehelwa mwe myoyo yenyu,” “Mwamzumila Chohile ni zumilani miye. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mwe nyumba ya Tate mna wikazi ulozize, hegu havyatendile ivyo sawagambileni seivyo. Nakuwaikiani hantu. <verse number="3" style="v" />Miye haheza kwita kuwaikiyani hantu, nanuye niwaguhani, chani nanywi mtende hadya nili. <verse number="4" style="v" />Sila ikwita uko hwita muimanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tomaso amgamba, “Zumbe, hachimanyize uko ukwita, Nachimanye vivihi isila yo kwitila uko?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Miye niyo isila, chindedi, na ujima, hahana akudaha kwita kwa Tate hanajinkile kwangu. <verse number="7" style="v" />Awagamba, Uneva mwanimanyize miye,” “namummanya Tate naye, kukongela haluse mummanya naho mumwona kale.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Filipo amgamba, “Zumbe, chilagise Tate, icho nicho chikunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Sikala na nyuwe chipindi chitali chose, nawe Filipo hunati kunimanya, Filipo? Mntu yoyose aniwone miye kamwona Tate. Haluse ni mbwani, naho, ukugamba, ‘Chilagise Tate’? <verse number="10" style="v" />Togola, hukuzumila, Filipo, kugamba miye ni mndani mwa Tate naye Tate emndani mwangu? Yesu awagamba, Milosi huwagambilani,” “sikuilonga kwa udahi wangu. Tate, emndani mwangu, adamanya ndima yakwe. <verse number="11" style="v" />Mwaungwa mnizumile halonga kugamba miye nimndani mwa Tate naye Tate emndani mwangu. Uneva sivyo ivyo, zumilani kwa ndima hudamanya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, akunizumila nadamanye mbuli hudamanya miye heye, nadamanye hata nkulu kujinka, kwaviya naita kwa Tate. <verse number="13" style="v" />Chochose namlombeze kwa zina dyangu, nanidamanye chani Tate atunywe kujinkila ko Mwana. <verse number="14" style="v" />Mkanilombeza chochose kwa zina dyangu, nanidamanye.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nawenke Muye Ukukukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Uneva mkanunga, namtoze malagizo yangu. <verse number="16" style="v" />Miye nami nanimlombeze Tate, ivyo naye nawenkeni mwambizi mtuhu, yudya nekale nanyuwe mazuwa yose. <verse number="17" style="v" />Uyo ni Muye Ukukile akugubula chindedi cha Chohile. Wantu we isi hawakudaha kumhokela, kwaviya hawakudaha kumwona hegu kummanya. Mna nyuwe mummanya, kwaviya ekala na nyuwe naho emndani mwenyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Saniwaseni ichedu, naniwawiyeni. <verse number="19" style="v" />Hasigala hadodo wantu we isi ino hawaniwone vituhu, mna nyuwe namniwone, na kwaviya miye ni mjima, nyuwe nanywi namtende wajima. <verse number="20" style="v" />Zuwa diya dikabula, nammanye kugamba miye ni mndani mwa Tate nanyuwe nanywi mwi mndani mwangu, na miye nimndani mwenyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Wantu wakuhokela malagizo yangu na kuyatoza awo nawo wakununga miye. Tate nawamunge wadya wakununga, miye nami naniwaunge na kwegubula kwawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yuda nuyo Yuda Isikaliyote awagamba, “Zumbe, neidahike vivihi weye kwelavyanya kwetu siyo kwa wantu we isi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Mntu akununga natoze mahinyo yangu. Tate namunge, naho Tate na miye nachize kwakwe kwikala naye. <verse number="24" style="v" />Mntu he kununga hakutoza mahinyo yangu. Naho mahinyo mwivile sayo yangu, mna ni ya Tate, anisigile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Siwagambilani mbuli zino nichei hamwenga na nyuwe. <verse number="26" style="v" />Mwambizi, Muye Ukukile, yudya Tate namsigilaga kwa zina dyangu, nawahinyeni chila chintu na kuwakumbusani yadya niwagambileni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Nawasizani utondowazi, nawenkani utondowazi wangu mwenye. Sikuwenkani nyuwe saviya wantu we isi wakutenda. Msekutumbwazika mwe myoyo yenyu, naho msekogoha. <verse number="28" style="v" />Mniva hawagambani, ‘Naita zangu, mna nani wawiyeni vituhu.’ Uneva mwanungile, namwelelwa kugamba naita kwa Tate, kwaviya Tate ni mkulu kujinka miye. <verse number="29" style="v" />Siwagambilani imbuli ino haluse hainati kulaila, chani umo ikalaila, mzumile. <verse number="30" style="v" />Sanilonge nanywi vituhu mbuli zilozize, kwaviya mkulu ywe isi eza. Hana udahi mwangu, <verse number="31" style="v" />mna wantu we isi ino waungwa wamanye kugamba namunga Tate, nivyo vikuleka nadamanya chila chintu saviya anisigile.</para>
  <para style="p">“Chimalani, chihauke hano.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu nuyo mzabibu we chindedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Miye ni mzabibu wa chindedi, Tate nuyo mlimi. <verse number="2" style="v" />Chila tambi mndani mwangu hedikweleka matunda uyo adyusa, chila tambi dikweleka, adisaswila dikale hatana chani dyelekese. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nyuwe mlenguka kale kwa chausa cha yadya mahinyo niwagambileni. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ikalani mndani mwangu, miye nami nikale mndani mwenyu. Tambi hadikudaha kweleka matunda hadinasigale mo mzabibu. Seivyo nyuwe nanywi hamkudaha kweleka matunda hamnekale mndani mwangu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Miye ni mzabibu, na nyuwe mwi matambi. Akwikala mndani mwangu, nami hekala mndani mwakwe, eleka matunda yalozize, kwaviya hamkudaha kudamanya chochose hamnatendile na miye. <verse number="6" style="v" />Mntu yeyose hanekale mndani mwangu adulwa kuse saviya tambi dikudulwa kuse niyo dyanyala, tambi saidyo wadilogota na kudidula mo moto, chani dihye. <verse number="7" style="v" />Mnekala mndani mwangu, na milosi yangu inekala mndani mwenyu, lombezani chochose mkunga, nanywi namwingwe. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tate atunywa uneva mkeleka matunda yalozize, na kutenda wanampina wangu. <verse number="9" style="v" />Saviya Tate akununga, miye nawaungani saivyo, ikalani mwe ungi wangu. <verse number="10" style="v" />Uneva mkatoza malagizo yangu, namwikale mwe ungi wangu, saviya miye hutoza malagizo ya Tate na kwikala mwe ungi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Siwagambilani izimbuli izo chani chinyemi changu chikale mndani mwenyu na chinyemi chenyu nacho chichinte. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ino niyo sigilizi yangu, mungane, saviya niwaungileni nyuwe. <verse number="13" style="v" />Hahana mta ungi mkulu ukujinka ungi wa mntu akulavya ujima wakwe kwa chausa cha wambuya zakwe. <verse number="14" style="v" />Na nyuwe mwi wambuya zangu uneva mkadamanya yadya niwasigileni. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nyuwe sikuwetangani wandima vituhu, kwaviya mndima hamanyize chikudamanywa ni zumbe dyakwe. Mna, miye siwetangani nyuwe wambuya, kwaviya siwagambilani yose yadya nimwivile Tate. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nyuwe hamnisagule miye, mna miye siwasagulani nyuwe na kuwasigila mwite mkeleke matunda, matunda yadya yakwikala. Tate naye nawenkeni chochose namlombeze kwa zina dyangu. <verse number="17" style="v" />Dino, nidyo, lagizo dyangu huwenkani, Mungane.</para>
  <para style="s">Wihi wa wantu we isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Uneva wantu we isi ino wanawaihiwani nyuwe, mmanye kugamba nawakonga kunihiwa miye. <verse number="19" style="v" />Hegu mwendile ni wantu we isi, isi naiwawaungani nyuwe sa wantu wakwe. Mna miye siwasagulani mgati mwe isi, nivyo vikuleka wantu we isi wakuwaihiwani. <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumbukani yadya niwagambileni, ‘Mtumwa suyo mkulu kujinka zumbe dyakwe.’ Uneva wantu wanisulumiza miye, nawawasulumize nyuwe nanywi, naho uneva watoza mahinyo yangu, nawatoze mahinyo yenyu. <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna nawawadamanyizeni nyuwe kwaviya mwi wangu, kwaviya hawammanyize yudya anisigile. <verse number="22" style="v" />Uneva sezile na kulonga nawo nahewana masa, mna haluse hawakudaha kwegombela kugamba hawana masa. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mntu akunihiwa miye amwihiwa na Tate. <verse number="24" style="v" />Uneva sadamanye kwawo mbuli ziya hehali mntu mtuhu azidamanye nkongo, nahawena masa, mna haluse wayawona yadya nidamanye, niyo wanihiwa miye hamwenga na Tate. <verse number="25" style="v" />Yano, yalaila chani yadya yawandikwe mwe Sigilizi yawo yachinte, ‘Wanihiwa vya bule.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Aho akwizila Mwambizi Muye, nikunga nimsigile kwenyu kulaila kwa Tate. Muye Ukukile wa chindedi akulaila kwa Tate, naukule chindedi chikununga miye. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nyuwe nanywi, ivyo namukule chindedi chikununga miye kwaviya namna miye kukongela nkongo.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Siwagambilani ayo, chani msekuleka uzumizi wenyu. <verse number="2" style="v" />Wantu nawawabalazeni mwe zinyumba zawo za kumvikila Chohile, naho chipindi cheza hadya chila akuwakomani nyuwe nagambe amsankanila Chohile. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nawawadamanyizeni mbuli zino kwaviya hawammanyize Tate hegu hawanimanyize miye. <verse number="4" style="v" />Mna siwagambilani mbuli zino, chani umo wakakonga kudamanya ayo, mkumbuke kugamba nawagambilagani.</para>
  <para style="p">“Siwagambileni mbuli zino kukongela nkongo, kwaviya nanihamwenga na nyuwe. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mna haluse naita kwa yudya anisigile, naho hahali yumwe ywenyu akunuza, waitahi? <verse number="6" style="v" />Kwaviya siwagambilani mbuli zino, myoyo yenyu imema chinyulu. <verse number="7" style="v" />Mna nawagambilani chindedi, nanivyedi miye nite, kwaviya sinaitile, Mwambizi heze kwenyu. Mna uneva ninaita nanimwigale kwenyu. <verse number="8" style="v" />Uyo aho akwizila, nawalavyanyize wantu we mwe isi kugamba fanyanyi zawo sizo za chindedi mwa masa yawo na kanto dya Chohile akunga akantile wantu. <verse number="9" style="v" />Waga mwe mbuli ya masa, kwaviya hawanizumile, <verse number="10" style="v" />waga mwe mbuli iwoneke yedi kulongozi kwa Chohile, kwaviya naita kwa Tate na nyuwe hamniwone vituhu, <verse number="11" style="v" />waga mwe mbuli ya kanto, kwaviya mkulu ywe isi ino kaheza kale kukantilwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nina yalozize yakuwagambilani, mna kwa haluse hamkudaha kuyajijimiza. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mna seivyo, aho, akwizila uyo Muye Ukukile, akugubula chindedi cha Chohile, nawalongoze mmanye chindedi chose. Uyo halonge kwa udahi wakwe mwenye, mna nalonge ayo neve na kuwagambilani yadya nayeze. <verse number="14" style="v" />Uyo nanitunye miye, kwaviya nawagambileni yadya nahokele kulaila kwangu. <verse number="15" style="v" />Vyose ananavyo Tate ni vyangu, nivyo vikuleka silonga kugamba uyo Muye Ukukile nawagambileni yadya yakulaila kwangu.</para>
  <para style="s">Chinyulu na Chinyemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chipindi chidodo hamniwone, na vikajinka chipindi chidodo namniwone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Wamwenga wa wanampina wakwe wauzana, “Agaze? Akachigamba chipindi chidodo hachimwone, na vikajinka chipindi chidodo nachimwone, naho agamba, ‘Kwaviya naita kwa Tate.’ <verse number="18" style="v" />Ivyo wauzana, agaze? ‘Chipindi chidodo’? Hachikumanya alonga mbwani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Yesu nakamanya kugamba nawakaunga wamuze, ivyo awagamba, “Mwauzana mbuli ya ziya nilongile, ‘Chipindi chidodo hamniwone, na chipindi chidodo na mniwone.’ Vino nivyo mkuzana mgati mwenyu? <verse number="20" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, nyuwe namwile na kulomboleza, mna wantu we isi nawelelwe, namwone chinyulu, mna chinyulu chenyu nachihituke chinyemi. <verse number="21" style="v" />Hadya mvyele akunga efungule, eva usungu kwaviya chipindi chakwe cho kwefungula chibula. Mna akaheza kwefungula, hakukumbuka usungu wakwe, kwaviya ana chinyemi kugamba katiti kelekwa mwe isi. <verse number="22" style="v" />Nyuwe nanywi mna usungu haluse, mna naniwezileni vituhu, nanywi nammeme chinyemi mwe myoyo yenyu, na chinyemi icho hahali mntu nadahe kuchusa kwenyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Zuwa idyo dikabula, hamnilombeze chochose. Nawagambilani chindedi, chochose namumlombeze Tate kwa zina dyangu nawenkeni. <verse number="24" style="v" />Hata vino haluse hamnati kulombeza chochose kwa zina dyangu, lombezani nanywi namhokele, chani chinyemi chenyu chichinte.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ana udahi mwe Isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Siwagambilani mbuli izo kwa miliganyo. Mna chipindi nachize umo sanilonge nanyuwe vituhu kwa miliganyo, mna naniwagambileni pwipwipwi mbuli ya Tate. <verse number="26" style="v" />Zuwa idyo aho dikwizila, namumlombeze Tate kwa zina dyangu, miye sikulonga kugamba naniwalombezeze kwa Tate, <verse number="27" style="v" />kwaviya Tate mwenye awaungani nyuwe. Awaunga kwaviya nyuwe mnunga miye naho mzumilani kugamba silawa kwa Chohile. <verse number="28" style="v" />Miye nalawaga kwa Tate, niyo neza mwe isi, haluse nayasa isi nauya kwa Tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Elo wanampina wakwe wamgamba, “Haluse walonga pwipwipwi vitendese, hwikujela mliganyo. <verse number="30" style="v" />Haluse chimanya kugamba weye kumanya chila chintu, hachunge mntu akuze mbuli yoyose. Vino vyachitenda chizumile kugamba walawaga kwa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Haluse mwazumila? <verse number="32" style="v" />Chipindi cheza, naho chibula kale, hadya nyuwe nyose namwaganikane, chila mntu kwakwe, miye nami nanasigwe ichedu. Mna miye sichedu, kwaviya Tate ehamwenga na miye. <verse number="33" style="v" />Siwagambilani mbuli zino chani mtende na utondowazi mo kulungana na miye. Wantu we isi nawawatende mkunte. Mna kwenkeni moyo! Miye isi siihuma!”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awalombezeza wanampina wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu eze alonge ivyo, kenula ameso kulanga kwembingu, na kugamba, “Tate, chipindi chibula! Mtunye Mwanawo, chani naye akutunye. <verse number="2" style="v" />Kwaviya nakumwinka udahi mwa wantu wose, chani awenke ujima wa mazuwa yose wadya wose umwinkile. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ujima wa mazuwa yose ni kukumanya weye, Chohile ywa chindedi, naho wammanye Yesu Kulisito umsigile. <verse number="4" style="v" />Miye sikutunya muno mwe isi, sibinda indima uninkile niidamanye. <verse number="5" style="v" />Haluse Tate, nitunya kulongozi kwako, ntunyo seidya nendile ninanayo hadya isi heinati kumbwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Sikutenda umanyike kwa wantu wadya uninkile mwe isi. Nendile ni wako, niyo waninka watende wangu. Nawo watoza ulosi wako, <verse number="7" style="v" />haluse wavimanya kugamba chila uninkile chilaila kwako. <verse number="8" style="v" />Miye siwenka udya ulosi uninkile, nawo wauzumila, wamanya kugamba chindedi silawa kwako, naho wazumila kugamba weye nakunisigila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nawalombezeza wowo. Sikulombezeza isi mna wadya wantu uninkile, kwaviya ni wako. <verse number="10" style="v" />Yose ninanayo ni yako, na yose unanayo ni yangu, naho ntunyo yangu iwoneka mwa awo uninkile. <verse number="11" style="v" />Haluse miye neza kwako, simuli muno mwe isi, mna wowo wachei mwe isi. Tate Mkuka! Wadime kwa udahi wa zina dyako, diya zina uninkile, chani watende umwe saviya suwe chi umwe. <verse number="12" style="v" />Hadya nendile ni hamwenga nawo, miye nasiwadima kwa udahi wa zina dyako, zina uninkile. Miye siwadima, naho hahali hata yumwenga ywawo agile, mna yudya mntu asagulwe chani age chani Yakukile yachinte. <verse number="13" style="v" />Haluse neza kwako, nasilonga mbuli zino nichei mwe isi chani chinyemi changu chichinte mwe myoyo yawo. <verse number="14" style="v" />Miye siwenka ulosi wako, nawo wantu we isi wawehiwani, kwaviya sawo wantu we isi, saviya miye suyo ywe isi. <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikulombeza uwause mwe isi, mna nalombeza uwadime na yudya Mwavu Shetani. <verse number="16" style="v" />Wowo sawo we isi, saviya miye nami suyo ywe isi. <verse number="17" style="v" />Uwalenguse mwe chindedi, ulosi wako ni chindedi. <verse number="18" style="v" />Saviya unisigile mwe isi, miye nami siwasigila wowo mwe isi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nelengusa mwenye chindedi kwako kwachausa chawo, chani wowo, nawo, welavye kwako.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Sikuwalombezeza awo du, mna nawalombezeza wose nawanizumile kwa ulosi wawo. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nalombeza chani wose watende wamwenga. Tate! Nalombeza wekale mndani mwetu, saviya weye ukwikala mndani mwangu miye nami nekala mndani mwako. Nalombeza watende wamwenga, chani wantu we isi wazumile kugamba ni weye unisigile. <verse number="22" style="v" />Miye siwenka ntunyo idya uninkile miye, chani watende wamwenga, saviya suwe chi wamwenga. <verse number="23" style="v" />Miye mndani mwawo na weye mndani mwangu, chani umwenga wawo uchintise, wantu we isi wamanye kugamba weye nakunisigila naho kugamba wawaunga saviya ukununga miye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tate! Naunga awo uninkile, naho naunga watende hamwenga namiye hantu hadya nili, chani wawone ntunyo yangu, ntunyo idya uninkile, kwaviya nakununga kukongela isi hainati kumbwa. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tate Ywedi, wantu we isi hawakumanyize, mna miye sikumanya, naho wamanya kugamba ni weye unisigile. <verse number="26" style="v" />Sikutenda wakumanye, naho nanijendeleze kutenda ivyo, chani ungi udya ukununga utende mndani mwawo, nami nikale mndani mwawo.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu agwilwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:47-56; Mako 14:43-50; Luka 22:47-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu eze alonge ivyo, niyo ahalawa na wanampina wakwe na kudeluka mto wa Kediloni. Naho wose wengila mwe chibuta cha miti, Yesu niyo engila umo hamwenga na wanampina wakwe. <verse number="2" style="v" />Yuda, yudya amhituke Yesu, nakamanya ahantu aho, kwaviya nkanana zilozize Yesu nakadugana na wanampina wakwe aho. <verse number="3" style="v" />Yuda niyo engila hechibuta, aguha fyo dya wankondo wa Chilumi, hamwenga na wamizi wasigilwe ni walavyantambiko wakulu na Mafalisayo, weza wenula taa na magala na viziha. <verse number="4" style="v" />Yesu nendile kavimanya vyose navimlaile, awalaila kulongozi kwawo na kuwauza, “Mwamlonda yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nawo wamhitula. “Yesu ywa Nazaleti,”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu awagamba, “Ni miye,”</para>
  <para style="p">Yuda, amhituke Yesu, nendile kachimala aho hamwenga na awo. <verse number="6" style="v" />Yesu eze awagambe, “Ni miye” wauya kunyuma niyo wafika madi. <verse number="7" style="v" />Yesu awauza vituhu, “Mwamlonda yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamhitula. “Yesu ywa Nazaleti,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yesu awagamba. “Siwagambilani kugamba ni miye,” “Uneva mwanilonda miye, walekeni wano watuhu waite.” <verse number="9" style="v" />Kalonga ivyo chani yadya alongile yachinte, “Tate, wadya uninkile sazize hata yumwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simoni Petulo, endaga na bamba, niyo adisomola amsenga idigutwi dya kulume mndima ywa Mlavyantambiko Mkulu,. Mndima uyo naketangwa Maliko. <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu amgamba Petulo, “Bamba dyako divuze mwe yala yakwe! Togola, nisekujinkila sila ya masulumizo ninkigwe ni Tate?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kulongozi kwa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fyo dya wankondo wa Chilumi hamwenga na mkulu ywawo ywa wamizi wa Chiyahudi niyo wamgwila Yesu, wamtaliza, <verse number="13" style="v" />niyo wamwigala kwa Anasi. Anasi endaga ni mkwewe dya Kayafa, yudya endaga Mlavyantambiko Mkulu mo umhilimo uwo. <verse number="14" style="v" />Uyo Kayafa nuyo awagambilaga Wayahudi kugamba ni vyedi mntu yumwe abanike kwa chausa cha wantu wose.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amlemela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:69-70; Mako 14:66-68; Luka 22:55-57</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simoni Petulo hamwenga na mwanampina mtuhu niyo wamtimila Yesu. Kwaviya yudya mwanampina nendile kamanyika kwa Mlavyantambiko Mkulu, ivyo kengila hamwenga na Yesu mwebalaza ye nyumba ya Mlavya ntambiko Mkulu, <verse number="16" style="v" />mna Petulo nendile kachimala kuse kwe nchili. Naho yudya mwanampina mtuhu endaga amanyike kwa Mlavyantambiko Mkulu niyo afosa kuse, alonga na mndima yumwenga ywa chiche mwamizi ywo lwivi, niyo ambasa Petulo mnyumba. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mndima uyo mwamizi ywo lwivi amuza Petulo, “Togola, weye nawe hwi mwanampina ywa mntu yuno?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo amgamba. “Bule, Suyo miye,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Wandima na wamizi wajimbaga moto kwaviya nakuna mpeho, nawakotela moto. Ivyo Petulo naye nakachimala hamwenga nawo akotela moto.</para>
  <para style="s">Mlavyantambiko Mkulu amuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:59-66; Mako 14:55-64; Luka 22:66-71</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mlavyantambiko Mkulu amuza Yesu mbuli za wanampina wakwe hamwenga na mbuli za mahinyo yakwe. <verse number="20" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Silonga na wantu wose mazuwa yose mo lumpe mwe isi, naho sihinya mahinyo yangu mwe nyumba zo kuvikila na mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, hantu Wayahudi wose wakudugana. Silongile chintu chochose kwa chinyele. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ni mbwani, naho, ukunuza miye? Wauze wadya wanivile. Wauzeni kugamba wamanya icho niwagambile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu eze alonge ivyo, yumwenga ywa wamizi achimale aho niyo amhuta ihi akagamba, “Togola, nivyo ukumhitula Mlavyantambiko Mkulu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Uneva silonga vihiye, mgambile chila mntu wihi wangu. Mna uneva silonga vyedi wanitoilani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anasi niyo amwigala Yesu, kwa Kayafa Mlavyantambiko Mkulu achei atalizwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amlemela Yesu vituhu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:71-75; Mako 14:69-72; Luka 22:58-62</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simoni Petulo nachei achimale akotela moto. Wantu watuhu niyo wamuza, “Togola, weye nawe hwi mwanampina ywa yuno mntu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna Petulo niyo alemela. Agamba. “Bule, suyo miye,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mndima yumwenga ywa Mlavyantambiko Mkulu, mlukolo ywa yudya akantigwe digutwi ni Petulo, amuza Petulo. “Togola, miye sikuwone kwechibuta hamwenga na yuno mntu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Petulo alemela vituhu. “Bule” Aho zogolo dyaila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa he chitala cha Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:1-2, 11-14; Mako 15:1-5; Luka 23:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chilo chilo vilongozi wa Wayahudi wamguha Yesu kulaila mwe nyumba ya Kayafa na kumwigala kwe nyumba ya mkulu ywe isi. Mna vilongozi wa Wayahudi hawengile mwe nyumba yo mkulu ywa Yudeya, kwaviya wanase kujelwa uzavu, chani wadahe kudya inyinka ye Pasaka. <verse number="29" style="v" />Elo, Pilato niyo awabasa kuse awagamba, “Mwamlaha mbwani mntu yuno?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Niyo wamhitula, “Hachamletile kwako uneva hakoile masa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pilato awagamba, “Hayani, mguheni nyuwe wenye mkamkantile vikuligana ne sigilizi zenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wayahudi wamhitula, “Suwe hachikungwa kumkantila mntu yoyose file.” <verse number="32" style="v" />Ivyo vitendeka chani ulosi alongile Yesu uchinte, kugamba nabanike vivihi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pilato niyo engila vituhu mwe nyumba yo Mkulu ywa Yudeya amwitanga Yesu. Amuza. “Weye nuyo Seuta ywa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Vino zimbuli ukunuza ni fanyanyi zako mwenye hegu ni mbuli utile kugambilwa ni wantu watuhu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pilato amhitula, “Togola, vino miye ni Myahudi? Ni wantu wako mwenye na Walavyantambiko Wakulu wakwinkize kwangu. Kudamanya mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Useuta wangu suwo we isi ino, uneva useuta wangu wendile we isi ino, wandima wangu nawanigombela nisekwinkizwa kwa vilongozi wa Wayahudi. Bule, useuta wangu suwo wa hano!” <verse number="37" style="v" />Elo Pilato amuza, “Haluse weye wi seuta?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula, “Ni weye ukulonga kugamba miye ni seuta. Miye nelekagwa na kwiza mwe isi kwa chausa chimwe, kulonga chindedi. Chila mntu akuzumila chindedi aniva.” <verse number="38" style="v" />Pilato amuza. “Chindedi ni mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akantilwa kukomwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:15-31; Mako 15:6-20; Luka 23:13-25</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato niyo awabasa vituhu Wayahudi kuse, awagamba, “Miye siwone masa yoyose kwa yuno mntu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Mna mazwela yenyu kugamba vyaungwa niwalekeile mfungwa yumwenga mwe Pasaka. Haluse mwaunga niwalekeileni Seuta ywa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aho waguta, “Bule, suyo uyo! Chaunga uchilekeile Balaba!” Uyo Balaba endaga mpolaganyi.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pilato niyo asigila Yesu aguhigwe, atoigwe nkome. <verse number="2" style="v" />Wankondo waluka chilemba cha miwa, wamvika komtwi, niyo wamvika nkazu ya chiseuta. <verse number="3" style="v" />Niyo wamwizila kulongozi kwakwe na kugamba, “Ndamsa, Seuta ywa Wayahudi!” Niyo wamhuta maihi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pilato niyo afosa kuse vituhu, awagamba, “Kaulani, nanimwigale hano heise, chani mmanye kugamba miye sina wihi niwone mwakwe.” <verse number="5" style="v" />Yesu afosa kuse, kavika chilemba cha miwa na nkazu ya chiseuta. Pilato awagamba, “Kaulani, mntu mwenye ni nuyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Walavyantambiko wakulu na wamizi we nyumba nkulu ya Chohile weze wamwone niyo waguta, “Mtundike mo msalaba! Mtundike mo msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato awagamba, “Elo mguheni, nyuwe wenye mkamtungike mo msalaba, kwaviya miye sina wihi niwone mwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Wayahudi wa mhitula, “Suwe china sigilizi, na kwakutimila isigilizi iyo aungwa abanike, kwaviya ketenda ni Mwana ywa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilato eze eve imilosi iyo engilwa ni woga vidala. <verse number="9" style="v" />Niyo engila mwe nyumba ya mkulu we isi ya Yudeya vituhu, amuza Yesu, “Walaila kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna Yesu hamhitule dyo dyose. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pilato amgamba, “Hukulonga na miye? Togola, humanyize kugamba miye nina udahi wa kukufungula na udahi wa kukusulumiza mo msalaba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Hwendile na udahi wowose mwangu hegu hwenkigwe ni Chohile. Kwachausa icho, yudya aninkize kwakwo ana masa yatendese.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kukongela aho Pilato alonda sila ya kumlekela, mna Wayahudi watula lwasu, “Unamlekela mntu uyo, weye hwi mbuyaye dya Zumbe ywa Lumi. Chila mntu akwetenda zumbe amhiga Zumbe ywa Lumi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilato eze eve imilosi iyo amleta Yesu kuse, niyo ekala mwe chigoda cho mkanti, hantu hakwitangwa, “Lwazo lwa mayuwe.” Kwa Chiebulaniya, Gabata. <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ni saa mtandatu nomsi, zuwa dye kweika mwe ngasu ye Pasaka. Pilato awagamba Wayahudi, “Kaulani Zumbe ywenyu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Wowo waguta, “Mkome! Mkome! Mtungike mo msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato awauza, “Togolani, nimtundike mo msalaba Zumbe dyenyu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Walavyantambiko wakulu wamhitula, “Suwe hachina seuta mtuhu mna Kaisali!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aho Pilato amjela Yesu mwe mikono yawo chani atungikwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awambwa mo Msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:32-44; Mako 15:21-32; Luka 23:26-43</para>
  <para style="p">Ivyo wamguha Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v" />Niyo alawa kuno kenula Msalaba wakwe kwita hantu hakwitangwa Gobela dya Mtwi. Mwe Chiebulaniya ni Goligota. <verse number="18" style="v" />Aho niyo wamtungika mo msalaba, hamwenga nahawambwa wantu watuhu waidi. Yumwenga kulume kwakwe yumwenga kumoso kwakwe. Yesu ne hagati. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pilato nakawandika mwe chibao lagiso niyo aika halanga ho msalaba, “Yesu Mnazaleti, Seuta ywa Wayahudi.” <verse number="20" style="v" />Wantu walozize wasomaga, kwaviya hantu aho Yesu atungikagwa mo msalaba hendaga haguhi no mzi. Ivyo Wayahudi walozize wasomaga idiwandiko idyo dyawandikagwa kwa Chiebulaniya na Chilatini na Chigiliki. <verse number="21" style="v" />Niyo walavyantambiko wa Wayahudi wamgamba Pilato, “Usekuwandika, ‘Seuta ywa Wayahudi,’ mna wandika vino mntu yuno nakagamba, ‘Miye ni Seuta ywa Wayahudi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilato ahitula, “Yadya niwandike, siwandika kale.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Wankondo weze wamtungika Yesu, niyo waguha izisuche zakwe, wazika machisa mane, kwa chila yumwenga chisa dyakwe. Naho niyo waguha suche yakwe ntuhu, suche iyo nahaina msumo. <verse number="24" style="v" />Wadya wankondo niyo wagambilana, “Chisekuitatula, mna chiitoile tegatega naimgwele yuhi.” Mbuli ino naidamanyika chani yachinte Mawandiko ya Kukile ivyo yakulanga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Wapangana izisuche zangu,</para>
  <para style="q">na isuche yangu waitoila tegatega.”</para>
  <para style="m">Ivyo nivyo wadamanye wankondo awo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Haguhi no msalaba wakwe Yesu wendaga wachimala mamiyakwe na lumbudye dya mamiyakwe na Maliyamu mkaza Kilopa na Maliyamu Magidalena. <verse number="26" style="v" />Yesu eze amwone mamiyakwe, ne haguhi hakwe kachimala yudya mwanampina amungile, amgamba mamiyakwe, “Mnala, kaula, yuno nuyo mwanawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vikaheza amgamba yudya mwanampina, “Haluse yuno nuyo mamiyako.” Kukongela aho yudya mwanampina niyo amguha ekale naye kukaya kwakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:45-56; Mako 15:33-41; Luka 23:44-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Yesu niyo amanya kugamba yose yachinta, chani Mawandiko Yakukile yachinte, agamba, “Nina nchilu.” <verse number="29" style="v" />Aho na hana chiya chimemile siki. Niyo watweza lendele mwe divai igwaduke, waika mlanga mwe tete, niyo wamwinkiliza mo mnomo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Yesu eze afyose iyo idivai, agamba, “Yachinta.”</para>
  <para style="p">Akaheza enamiza umtwi abanika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atungwa guha mo lubavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Yendaga zuwa dya kwemalanya, chani mili isekwikala mo msalaba mwe zuwa dyo kuhumula, kwaviya Zuwa idyo dya Kuhumula dyendaga zuwa kulu, Wayahudi wamlombeza Pilato viga vya wadya watundikwe mo msalaba vivunwe, mili yawo yuswe mo msalaba. <verse number="32" style="v" />Ivyo wankondo waita, wavivuna iviga vya yudya mntu wa nkongo na yudya wa kaidi wadya wendile watungikwe mo msalaba hamwenga na Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mna weze wamwitile Yesu wabwila kabanika kale, ivyo hawamvunile iviga. <verse number="34" style="v" />Mnkondo yumwenga niyo amtunga mo lubavu na guha, aho niyo yalaila sakame na mazi. <verse number="35" style="v" />Yudya awone imbuli iyo, kawona chani naywi mzumile yadya alongile ni chindedi, naho uyo kamanya kugamba alonga chindedi. <verse number="36" style="v" />Mbuli iyo idamanywa chani Mawandiko Yakukile yachinte, “Hahana hata vuha dyakwe dimwenga nadivunwe.” <verse number="37" style="v" />Mawandiko naho yagamba, “Nawamsinye yudya wamtungile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhambwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:57-61; Mako 15:42-47; Luka 23:50-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Yeze yajike, nahana mntu yumwenga akwitangwa Yusufu, nakekala ko mzi wa Alimataya, niyo aita kwa Pilato na kumlombeza umwili wa Yesu. Mntu uyo endaga mwanampina ywa Yesu kwa chinyele kwaviya nakawogoha vilongozi wa Wayahudi. Pilato niyo amzumila chani auguhe umwili wa Yesu, Yusufu niyo aita na kuguha umwili wa Yesu. <verse number="39" style="v" />Nikodemo aho nkongo ambasaga Yesu nechilo, niyo aita hamwenga na Yusufu, naho nakaguha manemane hamwenga na udi ukubula madebe maidi. <verse number="40" style="v" />Waidi awo wauguha umwili wa Yesu, wautaliza sanda hamwenga na manukato kutimilana na viya wazwele wayahudi mo kuhambwa. <verse number="41" style="v" />Hantu aho atungikagwa Yesu hendaga na chibuta, naho mwe chibuta icho mwendaga na mbila mpya heinati kuhambwa mntu yoyose mndani mwakwe. <verse number="42" style="v" />Kwaviya yendaga mwe kwemalanya vyedi mwe Zuwa dya Kuhumula, niyo wawika umwili wa Yesu mwe imbila idya.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu auyuka</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:1-8; Mako 16:1-8; Luka 24:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chilo chilo kuchei mavukuvuku mwe zuwa dya kuhumula, Maliyamu Magidalena nakaita kwe mbila, niyo awona diya idiyuwe dyusigwa holwivi lwe mbila. <verse number="2" style="v" />Niyo aguluka kwa Simoni Petulo na yudya mwanampina mtuhu aungagwa ni Yesu, akuwagambila, “Wamusa Zumbe mwe mbila, naho hachimanyize uko wamwikiye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ivyo Petulo hamwenga na yudya mwanampina mtuhu niyo waita kwembila. <verse number="4" style="v" />Wose waidi waguluka mna yudya mwanampina mtuhu kagulukisa kumjinka Petulo, kalongola kubula kwembila. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eze ename, asungila mndani niyo awona isanda, mna hengile mndani. <verse number="6" style="v" />Simoni Petulo naye eze amtimile, engila mwe mbila, umo kawona isanda, <verse number="7" style="v" />na isuche azingigwe Yesu mo mtwi. Iyo isuche nandile haihamwenga ne sanda, mna naizingwa saviya naili mo mtwi, ikwa hantu hakwe. <verse number="8" style="v" />Vikaheza yudya mwanampina mtuhu alongole kubula kwe mbila, niyo engila mndani. Awona niyo azumila. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nahawenati kumanya Mawandiko Yakukile yawandikwe kugamba vyaungwa auyuke. <verse number="10" style="v" />Niyo wanampina wauya kaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amlaila Maliyamu Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:9-10; Mako 16:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maliyamu nakachimala kuse kwembila. Kuno achei kwila, kafunama asungila kwe mbila. <verse number="12" style="v" />Niyo awona wandima wa kwembingu waidi wavikile suche zing'aile, wekala hadya umwili wa Yesu wagonezagwa, yumwenga ko mtwi ywa kaidi kweviga. <verse number="13" style="v" />Awo wandima wa kwembingu wamwuza, “Mnala, ni mbwani ukwila?”</para>
  <para style="p">Naye awagamba, “Wamusa Zumbe dyangu, naho simanyize uko wamwikiye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eze alonge ivyo, niyo ahituka kunyuma, amwona Yesu kachimala ahadya, mna asekumanya kugamba ni Yesu. <verse number="15" style="v" />Yesu amuza, “Mnala ni mbwani ukwila? Wamlonda yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Maliyamu nakafanyanya kugamba uyo ni mwamizi ywe chibuta, amgamba, “Mkulu, uneva ni weye umusize, nigambila uko umwikiye miye nimguhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Maliyamu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Naye Maliyamu ahituka, amgamba kwa Chiebulaniya, “Laboni.” Nuko kugamba “Mhinyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Usekunikufya kwaviya sinati kwita kulanga kwa Tate. Mna hita kwa walukolo wangu uwagambile, naita, kulanga kwa Tate nanywi nuyo Tati yenyu, Chohile ywangu nanywi nuyo Chohile ywenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ivyo Maliyamu Magidalena niyo aita akuwagambila wadya wanampina, awagamba, “Simwona Zumbe”. Nakugamba nakamgambila ivyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanampina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:16-20; Mako 16:14-18; Luka 24:36-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Yendaga chisingi cha zuwa dya kuhumula wanampina nawadugana hamwenga mndani mwe nyumba, nyivi nazivugalwa kwaviya nawakawogoha vilongozi wa Chiyahudi. Yesu niyo eza, achimala hagati hawo, awagamba, “Utondowazi utende kwenyu!” <verse number="20" style="v" />Eze alonge ivyo, niyo awalagisa imikono yakwe no lubavu lwakwe. Awo wanampina weleleswa kumwona Zumbe. <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu awagamba vituhu, “Utondowazi utende kwenyu! Saviya Tate anisigile miye nami nawasigilani nyuwe.” <verse number="22" style="v" />Eze alonge ivyo niyo awavila awagamba, “Hokelani Muye Ukukile. <verse number="23" style="v" />Hegu mnawalekeila wantu masa yawo, masa yawo nayalekeilwe. Mna hamnawalekeile, hawalekeilwe masa yawo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mna Tomaso zina tuhu naketangwa pacha nendile hahali umo Yesu akeza. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ivyo wadya wanampina watuhu wamgamba, “Chimwona Zumbe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Tomaso awagamba, “Sinawone nkwasulo ze mitunga mwe mikono yakwe, na kupampasa umkono wangu mo lubavu lwakwe, sanizumile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yeze yajinke mazuwa mnane awo wanampina nawehamwenga mudya mnyumba, Tomaso naye nehamwenga nawo, nyivi nazivugalwa, mna Yesu niyo eza, achimala hagati hawo, akalonga, “Utondowazi utende kwenyu!” <verse number="27" style="v" />Niyo amgamba Tomaso, “Ika ididole dyako hano, ukaule mikono yangu, ninka umkono wako ukaule ulubavu lwangu. Usekutenda na nkama, mna zumila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tomaso amhitula, “Weye wi Zumbe dyangu!, Weye wi Chohile ywangu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Togola, wazumila kwaviya kuniwona? Ujimbiko wimwe wadya wakuzumila mna hawaniwone.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vilekile Ichitabu chino chikawandikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Yesu kadamanya vilagiso wituhu vilozize kulongozi kwa wanampina wakwe mna havinati kuwandikwa mwe chitabu chino. <verse number="31" style="v" />Mna zino ziwandikwa chani mzumile kugamba Yesu ni Kulisito Mwambula, Mwana ywa Chohile, mzumile mtende na ujima kwa udahi wa zina dyakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanampina mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ivyo vize viheze, Yesu niyo awalaila naho wanampina wakwe mpezo mwe diziwa dya Tibeliya. Kawalaila vino; <verse number="2" style="v" />Simoni Petulo na Tomaso akwitangwa pacha na Nasanieli mkaya ywa mzi wa Kana mwe isi ya Galilaya, wana waidi wa Zebedayo hamwenga na wanampina watuhu waidi wa Yesu wendile wose wehamwenga. <verse number="3" style="v" />Simoni Petulo awagamba, “Nakulowa samaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nawo wamgamba, “Suwe naswi chaitanya na weye.” Niyo waita, wakukwela ngalawa, mna nechilo icho hawapatile chochose. <verse number="4" style="v" />Kwize kukonge kucha, Yesu nakachimala mpezo mwe diziwa, mna wanampina hawamanyize kugamba ni Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v" />Yesu awauza, “Wabwanga, hamnati mpate samaki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wowo wamhitula, “Bule! Hachinati kupata chintu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Dulani ulwavu ntendele ya kulume ye ngalawa, nanywi namlowe samaki.” Wadula ulwavu, mna hawadahile kuluvuta vituhu kwaviya samaki nazilozesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aho yudya mwanampina aungiswe ni Yesu amgamba Petulo, “Ni Zumbe!” Simoni Petulo eze eve kugamba mntu yudya ni Zumbe, ahadya evika suche yakwe, kwaviya nahavikile niyo apilikila mwa mazi. <verse number="8" style="v" />Wadya wanampina watuhu naweza na ngalawa kuno wakalukwesa ulwavu lumemile izisamaki. Naho nendile hawehale na kwe isi kunyaile, nazikabula nkacho gana kulaila kudya kunyaile. <verse number="9" style="v" />Weze wabule kunyaile, wawona nkala za moto ujimbigwe, mlanga mwakwe mwikwa samaki na mgate. <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Zileteni hano izisamaki izimwenga mlowile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Simoni Petulo akwela mwe ngalawa, akweseza kunyaile ludya ulwavu lumemile izisamaki nkulu gana na milongo mishano na ntatu. Samaki nazilozesa, mna ulwavu halukantike. <verse number="12" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Soni mdye.” Hahana hata mwanampina ajezize kumuza, “Weye wi yuhi?” Kwaviya nawavimanya ni Zumbe. <verse number="13" style="v" />Yesu eza, aguha mgate awenka akajika aguha samaki naho awenka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Iyo yendaga nkanana ya katatu Yesu kuwalaila wanampina wakwe eze auyuke.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asimwila na Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Weze wajike ukudya, Yesu amuza Simoni Petulo, “Simoni mwana ywa Yohana! Togola, wanunga miye kujinka wano?”</para>
  <para style="p">Naye amhitula, “Heye Zumbe, weye kuvimanya kugamba miye nakunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amgamba, “Lisa ngoto zangu.” <verse number="16" style="v" />Akaheza amgamba nkanana ya kaidi, “Simoni mwana ywa Yohana! Togola, wanunga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo amhitula, “Heye Zumbe, kuvimanya nakunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amgamba, “Dima izingoto zangu.” <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu amuza nkanana ya katatu, “Simoni mwana ywa Yohana! Togola, wanunga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Aho Petulo kengilwa ni chinyulu kwaviya kamuza nkanana ntatu, “Wanunga?” Niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, weye kumanya yose. Weye kuvimanya kugamba miye nakunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amgamba, “Lisa izingoto zangu! <verse number="18" style="v" />Nakugambila chindedi, hadya wendaga wi mbwanga nakuzwela kwevisa mwenye na kwita kokose ukunga. Mna aho ukunga udalahaile, nochumize mikono yako na mntu mtuhu nakuvike na kukwigala hwikunga.” <verse number="19" style="v" />Kwa kulonga ivyo, Yesu nakalagisa viya Petulo akunga abanike nakwigala ntunyo kwa Chohile. Akaheza amgamba, “Nitimila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Mwanampina Mtuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aho Petulo eze ahituke, amwona yudya mwanampina nakaungiswa ni Yesu atimila. Yuno ni yudya mwanampina ekalaga hajihi na Yesu mwe nkande ye Pasaka na kumuza, “Zumbe ni yuhi nakuhituke?” <verse number="21" style="v" />Petulo eze amuwone uyo, amuza Yesu, “Zumbe, togola yuno naye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Uneva haunga asigale kubula aho hwizila, wavyungilani? Weye nitimila miye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ivyo imbuli iyo niyo yazagala mgati mwa wadya walukolo kugamba mwanampina uyo haabanike. Mna Yesu hamgambile kugamba mwanampina uyo habanike, mna nakagamba, “Uneva haunga asigale kubula aho hwizila, wavyungilani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Uyo mwanampina nuyo aukule izimbuli zino na kuziwandika. Naswi chimanya kugamba alongile ni chindedi.</para>
  <para style="s">Nkomelezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kuna mbuli ntuhu zilozize adamanye Yesu, hegu uneva zawandikwe zose, chindedi isi yose hayachintile kwika ivitabu vyawandikwe.</para>
</usx>